{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_016nkxSmh5tMyBWDhHArMdnG","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: 'Original framing holds at full strength. Joint estimation is\n2\t  methodologically necessary AND empirically superior. Lead with ranking correction\n3\t  magnitude: \"G-MFRM achieves 7pp higher Kendall-τ with Chatbot Arena while providing\n4\t  interpretable contamination diagnostics.\" Real contamination is moderate-to-strong\n5\t  (median c_n ≈ 1.05), validating the mvp_002/003 regime assumptions. Confounding\n6\t  scatter r ≥ 0.4 confirms the OVB mechanism operates on real data. All 3 claims hold\n7\t  at full strength — AAAI main conference positioning confident. No narrative pivot\n8\t  needed. Paper structure follows Tier A: Section 2 opens with OVB observation + toy\n9\t  example showing 33% θ-RMSE degradation, Section 4 presents G-MFRM dominance across\n10\t  both benchmarks, Section 5 ablation shows each component contributes. Headline:\n11\t  \"On MT-Bench and Arena-Hard with 8 LLM judges, G-MFRM fair scores achieve 8.7% higher\n12\t  Kendall-τ with Chatbot Arena human votes than the best sequential baseline.\"\n13\t\n14\t  '\n15\timagined_experiments:\n16\t- name: multi_judge_data_collection\n17\t  plan_id: exp-001\n18\t  description: 'Collect multi-judge evaluation data on MT-Bench (80 items × 10 categories)\n19\t    and Arena-Hard (500 items) using 8 judges: GPT-5.5, Claude Opus 4.7, Claude Sonnet\n20\t    4.6, DeepSeek-V4-Pro, Qwen3-235B-A22B, Qwen3.6-27B, Llama 4 Maverick, Gemini 2.5\n21\t    Pro. Evaluate 22 target models with position swap. Collect full judge response\n22\t    generations for UDA baseline compatibility.\n23\t\n24\t    '\n25\t  expected_results:\n26\t    num_judges: 8\n27\t    num_target_models: 22\n28\t    mt_bench_items: 80\n29\t    arena_hard_items: 500\n30\t    total_judgments_mt_bench: 28160\n31\t    total_judgments_arena_hard: 176000\n32\t    api_cost_usd: 820\n33\t    vllm_gpu_hours: 95\n34\t    judge_agreement_fleiss_kappa: 0.42\n35\t    position_bias_rate_mean: 0.14\n36\t    position_bias_rate_std: 0.06\n37\t    missing_data_rate: 0.02\n38\t    judge_response_generation_success_rate: 0.97\n39\t  result_rationale: 'Best 档假设 ≥ 6 judges produce sufficient facet variance for identifiability。8\n40\t    judges 涵盖 4 家厂商 (OpenAI, Anthropic, DeepSeek, Meta/Qwen) 确保 d_j 分布有足够异质性。22 target\n41\t    models 包括已知 高污染 (GPT-4o, Claude 3.5 Sonnet 等训练数据覆盖广的模型) 和低污染 (新发布的 open-weight\n42\t    模型)， 保证 c_n 分布的方差。Fleiss κ ≈ 0.42 (moderate agreement) 是 LLM judge 的典型水平 (Zheng\n43\t    et al. 2023 报告 MT-Bench 上 GPT-4 与人类 agreement ~0.65，但多 judge 间 agreement 会更低)。Position\n44\t    bias 14% ±6% 基于已有文献 (MT-Bench position bias ~10-20%)。缺失率 2% 来自 API timeout 和 vLLM\n45\t    OOM，best 档下 基础设施运行稳定。总评测数量 ~204K judgments 提供充足的统计功效。\n46\t\n47\t    '\n48\t  tables:\n49\t  - name: 'Table: Judge Pool Summary'\n50\t    columns:\n51\t    - Judge\n52\t    - Provider\n53\t    - Type\n54\t    - Params\n55\t    - Position Bias %\n56\t    - Mean Score\n57\t    - Score SD\n58\t    rows:\n59\t    - - GPT-5.5\n60\t      - OpenAI\n61\t      - API\n62\t      - ~2T (est.)\n63\t      - '11.2'\n64\t      - '7.83'\n65\t      - '1.42'\n66\t    - - Claude Opus 4.7\n67\t      - Anthropic\n68\t      - API\n69\t      - ~1.5T (est.)\n70\t      - '8.7'\n71\t      - '7.61'\n72\t      - '1.58'\n73\t    - - Claude Sonnet 4.6\n74\t      - Anthropic\n75\t      - API\n76\t      - ~500B (est.)\n77\t      - '13.5'\n78\t      - '7.45'\n79\t      - '1.51'\n80\t    - - DeepSeek-V4-Pro\n81\t      - DeepSeek\n82\t      - API\n83\t      - 671B MoE\n84\t      - '16.1'\n85\t      - '7.29'\n86\t      - '1.63'\n87\t    - - Qwen3-235B-A22B\n88\t      - Alibaba\n89\t      - vLLM\n90\t      - 235B MoE\n91\t      - '18.3'\n92\t      - '7.12'\n93\t      - '1.71'\n94\t    - - Qwen3.6-27B\n95\t      - Alibaba\n96\t      - vLLM\n97\t      - 27B\n98\t      - '19.7'\n99\t      - '6.88'\n100\t      - '1.82'\n101\t    - - Llama 4 Maverick\n102\t      - Meta\n103\t      - vLLM\n104\t      - 400B MoE\n105\t      - '14.6'\n106\t      - '7.35'\n107\t      - '1.55'\n108\t    - - Gemini 2.5 Pro\n109\t      - Google\n110\t      - API\n111\t      - ~1T (est.)\n112\t      - '10.9'\n113\t      - '7.72'\n114\t      - '1.47'\n115\t  - name: 'Table: Target Model Coverage'\n116\t    columns:\n117\t    - Model\n118\t    - Family\n119\t    - Release Date\n120\t    - Expected Contamination Level\n121\t    - Arena Elo (ref)\n122\t    rows:\n123\t    - - GPT-5.5\n124\t      - OpenAI\n125\t      - 2026-03\n126\t      - High\n127\t      - '1382'\n128\t    - - GPT-4o\n129\t      - OpenAI\n130\t      - 2024-05\n131\t      - Very High\n132\t      - '1261'\n133\t    - - Claude Opus 4.7\n134\t      - Anthropic\n135\t      - 2026-04\n136\t      - High\n137\t      - '1375'\n138\t    - - Claude Sonnet 4.6\n139\t      - Anthropic\n140\t      - 2026-02\n141\t      - Moderate-High\n142\t      - '1338'\n143\t    - - Claude 3.5 Sonnet\n144\t      - Anthropic\n145\t      - 2024-06\n146\t      - Very High\n147\t      - '1268'\n148\t    - - Gemini 2.5 Pro\n149\t      - Google\n150\t      - 2026-01\n151\t      - High\n152\t      - '1355'\n153\t    - - DeepSeek-V4-Pro\n154\t      - DeepSeek\n155\t      - 2026-02\n156\t      - Moderate\n157\t      - '1342'\n158\t    - - DeepSeek-V3\n159\t      - DeepSeek\n160\t      - 2024-12\n161\t      - High\n162\t      - '1280'\n163\t    - - Qwen3-235B-A22B\n164\t      - Alibaba\n165\t      - 2025-10\n166\t      - Moderate\n167\t      - '1295'\n168\t    - - Qwen3.6-27B\n169\t      - Alibaba\n170\t      - 2026-03\n171\t      - Low-Moderate\n172\t      - '1245'\n173\t    - - Llama 4 Maverick\n174\t      - Meta\n175\t      - 2025-11\n176\t      - Moderate\n177\t      - '1302'\n178\t    - - Llama 4 Scout\n179\t      - Meta\n180\t      - 2025-11\n181\t      - Moderate\n182\t      - '1275'\n183\t    - - Mistral Large 3\n184\t      - Mistral\n185\t      - 2025-09\n186\t      - Moderate\n187\t      - '1265'\n188\t    - - Mixtral 8x22B v2\n189\t      - Mistral\n190\t      - 2025-07\n191\t      - Moderate-High\n192\t      - '1250'\n193\t    - - Phi-5\n194\t      - Microsoft\n195\t      - 2026-01\n196\t      - Low\n197\t      - '1230'\n198\t    - - Command R+ v2\n199\t      - Cohere\n200\t      - 2025-12\n201\t      - Low\n202\t      - '1225'\n203\t    - - Jamba 2\n204\t      - AI21\n205\t      - 2025-10\n206\t      - Low\n207\t      - '1210'\n208\t    - - Yi-2 Large\n209\t      - 01.AI\n210\t      - 2025-08\n211\t      - Moderate\n212\t      - '1240'\n213\t    - - GPT-4-turbo\n214\t      - OpenAI\n215\t      - 2024-04\n216\t      - Very High\n217\t      - '1248'\n218\t    - - Gemini 1.5 Pro\n219\t      - Google\n220\t      - 2024-05\n221\t      - Very High\n222\t      - '1252'\n223\t    - - Llama 3.1 405B\n224\t      - Meta\n225\t      - 2024-07\n226\t      - High\n227\t      - '1243'\n228\t    - - Claude 3 Opus\n229\t      - Anthropic\n230\t      - 2024-03\n231\t      - Very High\n232\t      - '1232'\n233\t  figures_description:\n234\t  - 'Figure: Judge severity distribution (violin plot of raw scores by judge), showing\n235\t    d_j heterogeneity across 8 judges. Expected pattern: proprietary large models\n236\t    (GPT-5.5, Claude Opus) cluster as lenient scorers (high mean), smaller open-weight\n237\t    models (Qwen3.6-27B) as harsher scorers.'\n238\t  - 'Figure: Inter-judge agreement heatmap (pairwise Cohen''s κ), showing moderate\n239\t    block structure by model family.'\n240\t  analysis: 'Data collection under best 档预期完整且高质量。8 judges 跨 5 家厂商确保 d_j facet 有足够异质性\n241\t    (judge severity SD ≈ 0.4-0.6 in Rasch logits)。22 target models 覆盖从 Very High 到\n242\t    Low contamination 的完整光谱，为 c_n 估计提供必要的方差。Position swap 产生 ~204K 总判断， 远超 MFRM identifiability\n243\t    所需最小观测数 (8 judges × 22 models × 80 items = 14,080 cells， 远大于参数数 22+80+8+22 = 132)。关键检查点：judge\n244\t    response generations 的 97% 成功率 确保 UDA baseline 有足够训练数据。\n245\t\n246\t    '\n247\t- name: item_exposure_estimation\n248\t  plan_id: exp-002\n249\t  description: 'Estimate per-item exposure e_i via three-source weighted composite\n250\t    pipeline on MT-Bench and Arena-Hard items. Primary source: item-level performance\n251\t    gap (original vs GPT-5.5/Claude-rephrased reference variants). Secondary: temporal\n252\t    signal, LogProber memorization scores. ConStat per-model delta as c_n validation.\n253\t\n254\t    '\n255\t  expected_results:\n256\t    ei_pipeline_internal_consistency: 0.68\n257\t    source_weight_performance_gap: 0.55\n258\t    source_weight_temporal: 0.25\n259\t    source_weight_logprober: 0.2\n260\t    mt_bench_ei_mean: 0.62\n261\t    mt_bench_ei_std: 0.28\n262\t    arena_hard_ei_mean: 0.45\n263\t    arena_hard_ei_std: 0.31\n264\t    mt_bench_high_exposure_items_pct: 0.38\n265\t    arena_hard_high_exposure_items_pct: 0.22\n266\t    reference_variant_quality_validation_score: 0.91\n267\t    cn_constat_validation_corr: 0.72\n268\t    logprober_coverage_pct: 0.45\n269\t    temporal_signal_coverage_pct: 0.6\n270\t    spline_difficulty_correction_r2: 0.78\n271\t  result_rationale: 'Best 档核心假设之一是 e_i estimation pipeline produces coherent signal\n272\t    (internal consistency ≥ 0.5)。 MT-Bench 的 e_i 均值高于 Arena-Hard (0.62 vs 0.45)，因为\n273\t    MT-Bench 发布更早 (2023-06)， 已被大量训练数据覆盖，而 Arena-Hard (2024-04) 相对较新且项目更多样。38% 的 MT-Bench\n274\t    项目 属于 high-exposure (e_i > 0.8)，这些主要集中在 coding 和 math 类别 (训练数据中这些领域的 benchmark\n275\t    overlap 最大)。三个信号源的权重反映其信息量：performance gap 最直接 (权重 0.55)， temporal signal 覆盖面广但噪声较大\n276\t    (0.25)，LogProber 精确但覆盖有限 (0.20，仅 45% 模型有 logprob API)。ConStat validation corr\n277\t    = 0.72 确认 fitted c_n 与外部 contamination 指标一致， 处于 best 档要求的 [0.6, 0.9] 范围中部。Spline\n278\t    difficulty correction R² = 0.78 表明难度校正 有效移除了 performance gap 中的 difficulty confound——否则难题上所有模型表现都差，会被错误\n279\t    标记为低暴露。\n280\t\n281\t    '\n282\t  tables:\n283\t  - name: 'Table: Exposure Estimation by MT-Bench Category'\n284\t    columns:\n285\t    - Category\n286\t    - N Items\n287\t    - Mean e_i\n288\t    - SD e_i\n289\t    - High Exposure %\n290\t    - Primary Source Avail\n291\t    - LogProber Avail\n292\t    rows:\n293\t    - - Writing\n294\t      - '10'\n295\t      - '0.71'\n296\t      - '0.22'\n297\t      - 50%\n298\t      - 100%\n299\t      - 45%\n300\t    - - Roleplay\n301\t      - '10'\n302\t      - '0.48'\n303\t      - '0.30'\n304\t      - 20%\n305\t      - 100%\n306\t      - 45%\n307\t    - - Reasoning\n308\t      - '10'\n309\t      - '0.55'\n310\t      - '0.27'\n311\t      - 30%\n312\t      - 100%\n313\t      - 45%\n314\t    - - Math\n315\t      - '10'\n316\t      - '0.82'\n317\t      - '0.18'\n318\t      - 60%\n319\t      - 100%\n320\t      - 45%\n321\t    - - Coding\n322\t      - '10'\n323\t      - '0.85'\n324\t      - '0.15'\n325\t      - 70%\n326\t      - 100%\n327\t      - 45%\n328\t    - - Extraction\n329\t      - '10'\n330\t      - '0.58'\n331\t      - '0.25'\n332\t      - 30%\n333\t      - 100%\n334\t      - 45%\n335\t    - - STEM\n336\t      - '10'\n337\t      - '0.63'\n338\t      - '0.26'\n339\t      - 30%\n340\t      - 100%\n341\t      - 45%\n342\t    - - Humanities\n343\t      - '10'\n344\t      - '0.35'\n345\t      - '0.28'\n346\t      - 10%\n347\t      - 100%\n348\t      - 45%\n349\t  - name: 'Table: Three-Source Ablation (Validation Split)'\n350\t    columns:\n351\t    - Source Combination\n352\t    - Internal Consistency (α)\n353\t    - ConStat c_n Corr\n354\t    - Notes\n355\t    rows:\n356\t    - - All three\n357\t      - '0.68'\n358\t      - '0.72'\n359\t      - Full pipeline\n360\t    - - Performance gap only\n361\t      - '0.58'\n362\t      - '0.64'\n363\t      - Baseline\n364\t    - - Perf gap + temporal\n365\t      - '0.63'\n366\t      - '0.68'\n367\t      - +4pp consistency\n368\t    - - Perf gap + LogProber\n369\t      - '0.65'\n370\t      - '0.70'\n371\t      - +6pp consistency\n372\t    - - Temporal only\n373\t      - '0.41'\n374\t      - '0.48'\n375\t      - Insufficient alone\n376\t    - - LogProber only\n377\t      - '0.52'\n378\t      - '0.57'\n379\t      - Good but sparse\n380\t  figures_description:\n381\t  - 'Figure: e_i distribution histograms for MT-Bench vs Arena-Hard, showing MT-Bench\n382\t    shifted right (higher exposure). Bimodal structure visible in MT-Bench: coding/math\n383\t    cluster at high e_i, humanities/roleplay cluster at low e_i.'\n384\t  - 'Figure: Scatter plot of e_i (performance gap method) vs LogProber Safe Score\n385\t    for the 45% of models with logprob access. Expected Pearson r ≈ 0.63, confirming\n386\t    convergent validity.'\n387\t  - 'Figure: Spline difficulty correction visualization — raw performance gap vs difficulty-corrected\n388\t    e_i, showing the correction flattens the difficulty confound.'\n389\t  analysis: 'e_i 估计在 best 档下表现良好。MT-Bench 的类别间 e_i 异质性 (coding/math 高, humanities/roleplay\n390\t    低) 与直觉一致，且与 ConStat 外部验证 corr=0.72 互相印证。关键发现是 MT-Bench 项目平均暴露度 显著高于 Arena-Hard，这为后续\n391\t    exp-003 中跨 benchmark 的 contamination magnitude 差异提供解释。 三个信号源的互补性在 ablation 中清晰可见：LogProber\n392\t    虽覆盖有限但对有覆盖的模型提供最精确信号， temporal signal 提供广覆盖但较粗的估计。Difficulty correction 的 R²=0.78\n393\t    确认了未经校正的 performance gap 会产生 ~22% 的系统性偏差（难题被低估暴露度）。\n394\t\n395\t    '\n396\t- name: gmfrm_real_data_fit\n397\t  plan_id: exp-003\n398\t  description: 'Fit G-MFRM three-stage pipeline on real data. Stage 1: MFRM (θ,b,d).\n399\t    Stage 2: e_i from exp-002. Stage 3: Joint gated model with e_i fixed, c_n as latent.\n400\t    Compare fair scores θ̂ with Chatbot Arena Elo.\n401\t\n402\t    '\n403\t  expected_results:\n404\t    kendall_tau_gmfrm_mt_bench: 0.87\n405\t    kendall_tau_gmfrm_arena_hard: 0.86\n406\t    kendall_tau_gmfrm_combined: 0.87\n407\t    kendall_tau_mfrm_only: 0.8\n408\t    kendall_tau_raw_average: 0.76\n409\t    spearman_rho_gmfrm: 0.93\n410\t    theta_rmse_vs_arena_elo_normalized: 0.089\n411\t    convergence_rhat_max: 1.03\n412\t    convergence_ess_min: 285\n413\t    convergence_divergent_transitions: 0\n414\t    cn_median: 1.05\n415\t    cn_iqr:\n416\t    - 0.52\n417\t    - 1.61\n418\t    cn_range:\n419\t    - 0.08\n420\t    - 2.34\n421\t    num_models_cn_gt_1: 12\n422\t    num_models_cn_lt_0_3: 4\n423\t    dj_range_logits:\n424\t    - -0.82\n425\t    - 0.95\n426\t    dj_sd: 0.48\n427\t    stage1_runtime_seconds: 1200\n428\t    stage3_runtime_seconds: 3800\n429\t    total_runtime_seconds: 5200\n430\t    graceful_degradation_check: 'Arena-Hard subset (low contamination): G-MFRM τ ≈\n431\t      MFRM τ within 0.01'\n432\t  result_rationale: 'Best 档假设 real c_n distribution has median ≥ 0.8。预测 median = 1.05，位于\n433\t    [0.8, 1.5] 范围中部偏下， 反映现实中的 contamination 是 moderate-to-strong 但非极端。这个水平接近 mvp_003\n434\t    的 DGP 设定， 因此合成数据中观察到的 joint vs sequential 优势 (τ +6.3pp, RMSE −43.8%) 可以部分迁移到真实数据。\n435\t    但真实数据的效应量会衰减约 30-40%，因为：(1) 真实 c_n 分布更离散、非均匀；(2) e_i 有估计误差 (exp-012 显示 σ=0.2 时\n436\t    θ-RMSE 仅增加 5.9%)；(3) 真实 d_j 和 c_n·e_i 的非正交性可能低于合成 设定。Kendall-τ = 0.87 高于 MFRM-only\n437\t    的 0.80 (+7pp)，对应真实数据上 contamination correction 的实质性改善。R̂ max = 1.03、ESS min =\n438\t    285 与 mvp_003 收敛质量相当 (mvp_003: R̂=1.03, ESS=224)， 因为真实数据量 (~204K judgments) 远大于\n439\t    MVP 合成数据，MCMC 有更多信息可利用。12/22 模型的 c_n > 1 表明过半模型存在实质性 contamination，支撑 Tier A 叙事。Arena-Hard\n440\t    子集的 graceful degradation (Δτ < 0.01) 确认当 contamination ≈ 0 时 G-MFRM 不损害估计质量。\n441\t\n442\t    '\n443\t  tables:\n444\t  - name: 'Table: G-MFRM Stage 3 Convergence Diagnostics'\n445\t    columns:\n446\t    - Parameter Group\n447\t    - N Params\n448\t    - R-hat Max\n449\t    - R-hat Mean\n450\t    - ESS Min\n451\t    - ESS Median\n452\t    rows:\n453\t    - - θ (model ability)\n454\t      - '22'\n455\t      - '1.02'\n456\t      - '1.005'\n457\t      - '420'\n458\t      - '680'\n459\t    - - b (item difficulty)\n460\t      - '580'\n461\t      - '1.03'\n462\t      - '1.008'\n463\t      - '310'\n464\t      - '550'\n465\t    - - d (judge severity)\n466\t      - '8'\n467\t      - '1.01'\n468\t      - '1.003'\n469\t      - '850'\n470\t      - '1120'\n471\t    - - c (contamination)\n472\t      - '22'\n473\t      - '1.03'\n474\t      - '1.012'\n475\t      - '285'\n476\t      - '480'\n477\t    - - σ_θ (ability SD)\n478\t      - '1'\n479\t      - '1.01'\n480\t      - '1.01'\n481\t      - '780'\n482\t      - '780'\n483\t    - - σ_c (contamination SD)\n484\t      - '1'\n485\t      - '1.02'\n486\t      - '1.02'\n487\t      - '520'\n488\t      - '520'\n489\t  - name: 'Table: Fitted c_n by Model (Top 10 Most Contaminated)'\n490\t    columns:\n491\t    - Model\n492\t    - c_n Posterior Mean\n493\t    - 95% CI\n494\t    - Arena Elo\n495\t    - θ_raw - θ_fair\n496\t    - Rank Change\n497\t    rows:\n498\t    - - GPT-4o\n499\t      - '2.34'\n500\t      - '[1.82, 2.91]'\n501\t      - '1261'\n502\t      - '+0.41'\n503\t      - '-3'\n504\t    - - Claude 3 Opus\n505\t      - '2.12'\n506\t      - '[1.61, 2.68]'\n507\t      - '1232'\n508\t      - '+0.38'\n509\t      - '-4'\n510\t    - - Gemini 1.5 Pro\n511\t      - '1.98'\n512\t      - '[1.48, 2.53]'\n513\t      - '1252'\n514\t      - '+0.35'\n515\t      - '-3'\n516\t    - - GPT-4-turbo\n517\t      - '1.85'\n518\t      - '[1.37, 2.39]'\n519\t      - '1248'\n520\t      - '+0.33'\n521\t      - '-2'\n522\t    - - Claude 3.5 Sonnet\n523\t      - '1.72'\n524\t      - '[1.25, 2.24]'\n525\t      - '1268'\n526\t      - '+0.31'\n527\t      - '-2'\n528\t    - - Llama 3.1 405B\n529\t      - '1.61'\n530\t      - '[1.14, 2.13]'\n531\t      - '1243'\n532\t      - '+0.28'\n533\t      - '-2'\n534\t    - - DeepSeek-V3\n535\t      - '1.45'\n536\t      - '[1.01, 1.95]'\n537\t      - '1280'\n538\t      - '+0.24'\n539\t      - '-1'\n540\t    - - Mixtral 8x22B v2\n541\t      - '1.32'\n542\t      - '[0.88, 1.82]'\n543\t      - '1250'\n544\t      - '+0.22'\n545\t      - '-1'\n546\t    - - GPT-5.5\n547\t      - '1.18'\n548\t      - '[0.78, 1.64]'\n549\t      - '1382'\n550\t      - '+0.18'\n551\t      - '0'\n552\t    - - Yi-2 Large\n553\t      - '1.08'\n554\t      - '[0.67, 1.55]'\n555\t      - '1240'\n556\t      - '+0.17'\n557\t      - '-1'\n558\t  - name: 'Table: Fitted d_j (Judge Severity)'\n559\t    columns:\n560\t    - Judge\n561\t    - d_j (logits)\n562\t    - 95% CI\n563\t    - Interpretation\n564\t    rows:\n565\t    - - Qwen3.6-27B\n566\t      - '0.95'\n567\t      - '[0.78, 1.13]'\n568\t      - Most severe\n569\t    - - Qwen3-235B-A22B\n570\t      - '0.62'\n571\t      - '[0.47, 0.78]'\n572\t      - Severe\n573\t    - - DeepSeek-V4-Pro\n574\t      - '0.31'\n575\t      - '[0.18, 0.45]'\n576\t      - Moderate\n577\t    - - Llama 4 Maverick\n578\t      - '0.15'\n579\t      - '[0.02, 0.28]'\n580\t      - Slightly severe\n581\t    - - Claude Sonnet 4.6\n582\t      - '-0.08'\n583\t      - '[-0.21, 0.06]'\n584\t      - Near average\n585\t    - - Gemini 2.5 Pro\n586\t      - '-0.25'\n587\t      - '[-0.39, -0.11]'\n588\t      - Lenient\n589\t    - - Claude Opus 4.7\n590\t      - '-0.48'\n591\t      - '[-0.63, -0.34]'\n592\t      - Lenient\n593\t    - - GPT-5.5\n594\t      - '-0.82'\n595\t      - '[-0.98, -0.67]'\n596\t      - Most lenient\n597\t  figures_description:\n598\t  - 'Figure: θ_raw vs θ_fair scatter (22 models), with arrows showing rank displacement.\n599\t    High-c_n models (GPT-4o, Claude 3 Opus) shift down; low-c_n models (Phi-5, Command\n600\t    R+) shift up. Arrow length proportional to c_n. Color by contamination tier.'\n601\t  - 'Figure: Posterior c_n violin plots for all 22 models, ordered by posterior mean.\n602\t    Clear separation between high/low contamination groups. Dashed line at c_n = 0.3\n603\t    (negligible contamination threshold).'\n604\t  - 'Figure: Trace plots for 4 representative parameters (θ_GPT-5.5, c_n_GPT-4o, d_GPT-5.5,\n605\t    b_item42). All show good mixing with no trends.'\n606\t  - 'Figure: Per-benchmark G-MFRM τ comparison bar chart — MT-Bench vs Arena-Hard.\n607\t    MT-Bench shows larger G-MFRM advantage (higher contamination), Arena-Hard shows\n608\t    modest advantage.'\n609\t  analysis: 'G-MFRM 在真实数据上的表现完全支撑 Tier A 叙事。核心发现：(1) c_n median = 1.05 确认现实 contamination\n610\t    处于 moderate-to-strong 范围，与 mvp_002/003 假设一致；(2) 12/22 模型 c_n > 1， old-generation\n611\t    模型 (GPT-4o, Claude 3 Opus, Gemini 1.5 Pro) 污染最重，符合直觉——这些模型 训练数据更可能包含 MT-Bench/Arena-Hard\n612\t    原始题目；(3) 收敛质量优良 (R̂ ≤ 1.03, ESS ≥ 285)， 与 mvp_003 可比；(4) Arena-Hard 上 G-MFRM 优势略小，因为该\n613\t    benchmark 更新、暴露度更低， 这恰好验证了 graceful degradation——当 contamination 低时，G-MFRM 不做有害调整。\n614\t    Judge severity 的分布符合预期：smaller open-weight models 更严格，大型 proprietary models 更宽松。\n615\t\n616\t    '\n617\t- name: baseline_comparison\n618\t  plan_id: exp-004\n619\t  description: 'Compare G-MFRM against 8 baselines on same data. Metrics: Kendall-τ,\n620\t    Spearman-ρ with Chatbot Arena. Include rank change analysis and post-hoc power\n621\t    analysis.\n622\t\n623\t    '\n624\t  expected_results:\n625\t    kendall_tau_raw_average: 0.76\n626\t    kendall_tau_mfrm_only: 0.8\n627\t    kendall_tau_sequential_bias_first: 0.79\n628\t    kendall_tau_sequential_contam_first: 0.78\n629\t    kendall_tau_cyclicjudge: 0.81\n630\t    kendall_tau_cyclicjudge_discard: 0.8\n631\t    kendall_tau_dcr: 0.77\n632\t    kendall_tau_uda: 0.82\n633\t    kendall_tau_prefleak: 0.79\n634\t    kendall_tau_gmfrm: 0.87\n635\t    delta_tau_vs_best_baseline: 0.05\n636\t    best_baseline_name: UDA\n637\t    delta_tau_p_value_wilcoxon: 0.008\n638\t    spearman_rho_gmfrm: 0.93\n639\t    spearman_rho_best_baseline: 0.88\n640\t    rank_change_top5_stability_gmfrm: 0.9\n641\t    rank_change_top5_stability_raw: 0.7\n642\t    rank_change_max_displacement: 4\n643\t    rank_change_mean_displacement: 1.6\n644\t    post_hoc_power_at_observed_delta: 0.86\n645\t    n_models: 22\n646\t  result_rationale: 'Best 档要求 delta_tau_vs_best_baseline ∈ [0.04, 0.10] 且 p ∈ [0.001,\n647\t    0.03]。预测 Δτ = 0.05, p = 0.008。UDA 是最强 baseline (τ = 0.82)，因为它通过 neural K-factor\n648\t    调整隐式捕捉了部分 judge-item interaction，但它是 black-box 且 contamination-unaware，因此在高污染模型上仍会\n649\t    overestimate ability。CyclicJudge (τ = 0.81) 次之，round-robin 消除了 average judge bias\n650\t    但无法处理 item-specific judge effects 和 contamination。Sequential pipeline 表现差于 MFRM-only\n651\t    和 CyclicJudge，因为 OVB 导致第一阶段的偏差传递到第二阶段——这直接支持 Claim 1 (confounding claim)。DCR (τ\n652\t    = 0.77) 仅调整 contamination 不调整 judge bias，因此效果有限。 Post-hoc power = 0.86 > 0.80\n653\t    阈值，22 models 提供足够的统计功效检测 Δτ = 0.05。 Top-5 stability 从 raw 的 0.70 提升到 G-MFRM 的\n654\t    0.90，表明 contamination correction 主要影响 mid-tier 模型的排名，top models 的相对顺序更稳定但绝对位置有调整。\n655\t\n656\t    '\n657\t  tables:\n658\t  - name: 'Table: Main Result — Method Comparison (Combined MT-Bench + Arena-Hard)'\n659\t    columns:\n660\t    - Method\n661\t    - Kendall-τ\n662\t    - Spearman-ρ\n663\t    - Mean Rank Δ\n664\t    - Bias-Aware?\n665\t    - Contam-Aware?\n666\t    rows:\n667\t    - - Raw Multi-Judge Average\n668\t      - '0.760'\n669\t      - '0.842'\n670\t      - ref\n671\t      - 'No'\n672\t      - 'No'\n673\t    - - MFRM-only\n674\t      - '0.800'\n675\t      - '0.871'\n676\t      - '1.2'\n677\t      - 'Yes'\n678\t      - 'No'\n679\t    - - Sequential (bias→contam)\n680\t      - '0.790'\n681\t      - '0.863'\n682\t      - '1.8'\n683\t      - Partial\n684\t      - Partial\n685\t    - - Sequential (contam→bias)\n686\t      - '0.780'\n687\t      - '0.855'\n688\t      - '2.1'\n689\t      - Partial\n690\t      - Partial\n691\t    - - CyclicJudge\n692\t      - '0.810'\n693\t      - '0.878'\n694\t      - '1.0'\n695\t      - 'Yes'\n696\t      - 'No'\n697\t    - - CyclicJudge + Item Discard\n698\t      - '0.800'\n699\t      - '0.870'\n700\t      - '1.1'\n701\t      - 'Yes'\n702\t      - Partial\n703\t    - - DCR Factor\n704\t      - '0.770'\n705\t      - '0.848'\n706\t      - '0.8'\n707\t      - 'No'\n708\t      - 'Yes'\n709\t    - - UDA\n710\t      - '0.820'\n711\t      - '0.885'\n712\t      - '1.3'\n713\t      - Yes (implicit)\n714\t      - 'No'\n715\t    - - Preference Leakage Calib.\n716\t      - '0.790'\n717\t      - '0.862'\n718\t      - '0.9'\n719\t      - Partial\n720\t      - 'No'\n721\t    - - G-MFRM (ours)\n722\t      - '**0.870**'\n723\t      - '**0.930**'\n724\t      - '**1.6**'\n725\t      - 'Yes'\n726\t      - 'Yes'\n727\t  - name: 'Table: Rank Change Analysis — Models with Largest Displacement'\n728\t    columns:\n729\t    - Model\n730\t    - Raw Rank\n731\t    - G-MFRM Rank\n732\t    - Displacement\n733\t    - c_n\n734\t    - Direction\n735\t    rows:\n736\t    - - Claude 3 Opus\n737\t      - '8'\n738\t      - '12'\n739\t      - '-4'\n740\t      - '2.12'\n741\t      - Overestimated → corrected down\n742\t    - - GPT-4o\n743\t      - '10'\n744\t      - '13'\n745\t      - '-3'\n746\t      - '2.34'\n747\t      - Overestimated → corrected down\n748\t    - - Gemini 1.5 Pro\n749\t      - '9'\n750\t      - '12'\n751\t      - '-3'\n752\t      - '1.98'\n753\t      - Overestimated → corrected down\n754\t    - - Phi-5\n755\t      - '18'\n756\t      - '15'\n757\t      - '+3'\n758\t      - '0.15'\n759\t      - Underestimated → corrected up\n760\t    - - Command R+ v2\n761\t      - '20'\n762\t      - '17'\n763\t      - '+3'\n764\t      - '0.12'\n765\t      - Underestimated → corrected up\n766\t    - - GPT-4-turbo\n767\t      - '12'\n768\t      - '14'\n769\t      - '-2'\n770\t      - '1.85'\n771\t      - Overestimated → corrected down\n772\t  - name: 'Table: Post-hoc Power Analysis'\n773\t    columns:\n774\t    - Comparison\n775\t    - Observed Δτ\n776\t    - N\n777\t    - Power (α=0.05)\n778\t    - Min N for Power=0.80\n779\t    rows:\n780\t    - - G-MFRM vs UDA\n781\t      - '0.05'\n782\t      - '22'\n783\t      - '0.86'\n784\t      - '18'\n785\t    - - G-MFRM vs CyclicJudge\n786\t      - '0.06'\n787\t      - '22'\n788\t      - '0.91'\n789\t      - '15'\n790\t    - - G-MFRM vs Sequential\n791\t      - '0.08'\n792\t      - '22'\n793\t      - '0.97'\n794\t      - '10'\n795\t    - - G-MFRM vs Raw\n796\t      - '0.11'\n797\t      - '22'\n798\t      - '0.99'\n799\t      - '8'\n800\t  figures_description:\n801\t  - 'Figure: Bar chart of Kendall-τ for all 9 methods, with 95% bootstrap CI. G-MFRM\n802\t    bar clearly separated from cluster of baselines. Error bars non-overlapping with\n803\t    best baseline (UDA).'\n804\t  - 'Figure: Rank displacement plot — each model is a horizontal arrow from raw rank\n805\t    to G-MFRM rank. Arrow color by c_n magnitude. High-c_n models shift right (rank\n806\t    worsens), low-c_n models shift left (rank improves).'\n807\t  - 'Figure: Top-k stability curve (k = 3, 5, 10, 15, 20) for Raw, MFRM, UDA, and\n808\t    G-MFRM. G-MFRM dominates at all k, largest gap at k=10.'\n809\t  analysis: 'G-MFRM 在所有指标上显著超越全部 8 个 baseline，Δτ = +0.05 vs UDA (p = 0.008)。结果的 核心模式完全符合\n810\t    Claim 3 的预测：(1) 仅处理 bias 的方法 (CyclicJudge, MFRM-only) 优于 raw average 但 inferior\n811\t    to G-MFRM，因为忽略 contamination；(2) 仅处理 contamination 的方法 (DCR) 效果最差，因为 judge severity\n812\t    confound 未被处理；(3) sequential pipeline 表现甚至 不如单独的 CyclicJudge，直接支持 Claim 1——sequential\n813\t    的 OVB 产生了反效果。 Rank change analysis 证实了 contamination correction 的实际意义：old-generation\n814\t    高污染模型 (GPT-4o, Claude 3 Opus) 被系统性高估了 2-4 个排名位置。Post-hoc power 0.86 确认 22 models\n815\t    足以检测观察到的效应量。\n816\t\n817\t    '\n818\t- name: contamination_magnitude_calibration\n819\t  plan_id: exp-005\n820\t  description: 'Compare fitted c_n from exp-003 with synthetic MVP assumptions. Determine\n821\t    if real contamination is closer to mvp_001 (weak) or mvp_002/003 (strong). Critical\n822\t    decision point for claim calibration.\n823\t\n824\t    '\n825\t  expected_results:\n826\t    real_cn_median: 1.05\n827\t    real_cn_mean: 1.14\n828\t    real_cn_std: 0.72\n829\t    real_cn_iqr:\n830\t    - 0.52\n831\t    - 1.61\n832\t    closest_mvp: mvp_003\n833\t    mvp_003_cn_median: 1.2\n834\t    mvp_001_cn_median: 0.5\n835\t    ratio_real_to_mvp003: 0.875\n836\t    high_contamination_model_count: 12\n837\t    low_contamination_model_count: 4\n838\t    negligible_contamination_model_count: 6\n839\t    tier_determination: Tier A\n840\t    confounding_scatter_r: 0.55\n841\t    confounding_scatter_p: 0.008\n842\t    theta_bias_direction: positive (high c_n models overestimated)\n843\t    mt_bench_cn_median: 1.25\n844\t    arena_hard_cn_median: 0.78\n845\t  result_rationale: 'Best 档核心假设是 real c_n median ≥ 0.8。预测 median = 1.05，接近但略低于 mvp_003\n846\t    设定 (median ~1.2)。这是因为：(1) 现实中 contamination 的分布比合成 DGP 更离散—— 部分模型 (Phi-5, Command\n847\t    R+) 训练数据确实不包含 MT-Bench/Arena-Hard，c_n ≈ 0； (2) 但 old-generation models (GPT-4o,\n848\t    Claude 3 Opus, Gemini 1.5 Pro) 的 c_n > 1.8， 说明这些模型的训练数据高度覆盖了这些 benchmarks；(3)\n849\t    整体分布是右偏的 heavy-tailed 分布，median < mean。MT-Bench 的 c_n median (1.25) 高于 Arena-Hard\n850\t    (0.78)，因为 MT-Bench 更老、更广为人知。Confounding scatter r = 0.55 处于 best 档范围 [0.4, 0.7]\n851\t    中部，表明 sequential estimator 确实在高 c_n 模型上系统性高估 θ，OVB 机制在真实数据上 得到验证。Tier A 判定成立：contamination\n852\t    足够强，joint estimation 的优势有实际意义。\n853\t\n854\t    '\n855\t  tables:\n856\t  - name: 'Table: Real vs Synthetic Contamination Magnitude'\n857\t    columns:\n858\t    - Source\n859\t    - c_n Median\n860\t    - c_n Mean\n861\t    - c_n SD\n862\t    - IQR\n863\t    - Best Tier Match\n864\t    rows:\n865\t    - - mvp_001 (weak)\n866\t      - '0.50'\n867\t      - '0.50'\n868\t      - '0.25'\n869\t      - '[0.33, 0.67]'\n870\t      - 'No'\n871\t    - - mvp_002 (strong, unconverged)\n872\t      - '1.30'\n873\t      - '1.30'\n874\t      - '0.60'\n875\t      - '[0.85, 1.75]'\n876\t      - Partial\n877\t    - - mvp_003 (strong, converged)\n878\t      - '1.20'\n879\t      - '1.20'\n880\t      - '0.55'\n881\t      - '[0.78, 1.62]'\n882\t      - Closest\n883\t    - - Real data (exp-003)\n884\t      - '1.05'\n885\t      - '1.14'\n886\t      - '0.72'\n887\t      - '[0.52, 1.61]'\n888\t      - Tier A confirmed\n889\t  - name: 'Table: Per-Benchmark Contamination Summary'\n890\t    columns:\n891\t    - Benchmark\n892\t    - N Items\n893\t    - c_n Median\n894\t    - Mean e_i\n895\t    - High-c Models\n896\t    - Tier\n897\t    rows:\n898\t    - - MT-Bench\n899\t      - '80'\n900\t      - '1.25'\n901\t      - '0.62'\n902\t      - 14/22\n903\t      - A (strong)\n904\t    - - Arena-Hard\n905\t      - '500'\n906\t      - '0.78'\n907\t      - '0.45'\n908\t      - 9/22\n909\t      - A (borderline)\n910\t    - - Combined\n911\t      - '580'\n912\t      - '1.05'\n913\t      - '0.47'\n914\t      - 12/22\n915\t      - A\n916\t  figures_description:\n917\t  - 'Figure: c_n distribution comparison — overlaid density plots for mvp_001, mvp_003,\n918\t    and real data. Real distribution sits between mvp_001 and mvp_003 but closer to\n919\t    mvp_003, with heavier right tail.'\n920\t  - 'Figure: Confounding scatter plot — x-axis: c_n (contamination susceptibility),\n921\t    y-axis: θ_sequential - θ_joint (bias). Pearson r = 0.55. Each dot is a model.\n922\t    Regression line with 95% CI shaded. Clear positive trend: high c_n → sequential\n923\t    overestimates.'\n924\t  - 'Figure: Per-benchmark c_n violin plots side by side, showing MT-Bench has systematically\n925\t    higher contamination than Arena-Hard.'\n926\t  analysis: '实验明确确认 Tier A 叙事。real c_n median = 1.05 落在 best 档 [0.8, 1.5] 范围内， 最接近\n927\t    mvp_003 设定。关键的 confounding scatter r = 0.55 证明 OVB 机制在真实数据上 不仅存在而且具有实际显著性 (p =\n928\t    0.008)。跨 benchmark 分析显示一个有趣的模式： MT-Bench contamination 更强但 Arena-Hard contamination\n929\t    也不可忽略——这意味着 G-MFRM 在两个 benchmark 上都有修正价值，但 MT-Bench 上的修正更大。这个发现本身 就有独立的方法论价值：不同\n930\t    benchmark 的 contamination 程度不同，joint estimation 的收益与 benchmark 年龄/知名度正相关。Tier\n931\t    A 判定使 paper framing 无需调整， 三个 claims 都可以 full strength 呈现。\n932\t\n933\t    '\n934\t- name: judge_count_sensitivity\n935\t  plan_id: exp-006\n936\t  description: 'Sensitivity analysis: vary number of judges (2, 4, 6, 8) and measure\n937\t    G-MFRM performance degradation. Include leave-one-judge-out residual diagnostic\n938\t    for preference leakage detection.\n939\t\n940\t    '\n941\t  expected_results:\n942\t    tau_8_judges: 0.87\n943\t    tau_6_judges: 0.85\n944\t    tau_4_judges: 0.82\n945\t    tau_2_judges: 0.78\n946\t    min_judges_for_superiority_over_sequential: 4\n947\t    min_judges_for_superiority_over_best_baseline: 6\n948\t    graceful_degradation_at_2_judges: G-MFRM ≈ MFRM (Δτ < 0.01)\n949\t    leave_one_out_max_residual_change: 0.08\n950\t    leave_one_out_flagged_judge: none (no preference leakage detected)\n951\t    same_family_residual_inflation: 0.03\n952\t    rhat_max_at_4_judges: 1.04\n953\t    rhat_max_at_2_judges: 1.08\n954\t    ess_min_at_4_judges: 180\n955\t    ess_min_at_2_judges: 95\n956\t  result_rationale: 'Best 档假设 ≥ 6 judges produce sufficient facet variance for identifiability。随着\n957\t    judge 数量 减少，d_j facet 的信息量下降，c_n 和 d_j 的区分变困难。8→6 judges 时性能仅轻微下降 (τ −0.02) 因为\n958\t    6 judges 仍然提供足够的 facet heterogeneity。6→4 时下降加速 (τ −0.03) 因为 judge 多样性 显著降低。4→2\n959\t    时 G-MFRM 退化到接近 MFRM 水平 (τ = 0.78 ≈ MFRM 0.80)，因为 2 judges 无法 同时 identify d_j 和\n960\t    c_n——这符合理论预期 (2 judges 只有 1 个 severity contrast)。关键阈值： 4 judges 仍优于 sequential\n961\t    (0.82 > 0.79)，6 judges 优于 best baseline UDA (0.85 > 0.82)。 Convergence 在 4 judges\n962\t    时仍可接受 (R̂ ≤ 1.04, ESS ≥ 180) 但 2 judges 时 R̂ = 1.08 > 1.05 阈值， ESS = 95 < 150\n963\t    阈值。Leave-one-out 分析未检测到明显的 preference leakage——在 best 档下， 8 judges 的 round-robin\n964\t    设计足以稀释 same-family bias (PLS ~23.6% 被 7 个其他 judges 稀释)。\n965\t\n966\t    '\n967\t  tables:\n968\t  - name: 'Table: Judge Count Sensitivity'\n969\t    columns:\n970\t    - N Judges\n971\t    - Kendall-τ\n972\t    - Δτ vs Best Baseline\n973\t    - R-hat Max\n974\t    - ESS Min\n975\t    - Convergence OK?\n976\t    rows:\n977\t    - - 8 (full)\n978\t      - '0.870'\n979\t      - '+0.050'\n980\t      - '1.03'\n981\t      - '285'\n982\t      - 'Yes'\n983\t    - - '6'\n984\t      - '0.850'\n985\t      - '+0.030'\n986\t      - '1.03'\n987\t      - '230'\n988\t      - 'Yes'\n989\t    - - '4'\n990\t      - '0.820'\n991\t      - '+0.000'\n992\t      - '1.04'\n993\t      - '180'\n994\t      - 'Yes'\n995\t    - - '2'\n996\t      - '0.780'\n997\t      - −0.040\n998\t      - '1.08'\n999\t      - '95'\n1000\t      - 'No'\n1001\t  - name: 'Table: Leave-One-Judge-Out Residual Diagnostics'\n1002\t    columns:\n1003\t    - Removed Judge\n1004\t    - Δτ\n1005\t    - Max Residual Change\n1006\t    - Same-Family Inflation\n1007\t    - Flagged?\n1008\t    rows:\n1009\t    - - GPT-5.5\n1010\t      - '-0.008'\n1011\t      - '0.06'\n1012\t      - '0.03'\n1013\t      - 'No'\n1014\t    - - Claude Opus 4.7\n1015\t      - '-0.005'\n1016\t      - '0.04'\n1017\t      - '0.02'\n1018\t      - 'No'\n1019\t    - - Claude Sonnet 4.6\n1020\t      - '-0.003'\n1021\t      - '0.03'\n1022\t      - '0.02'\n1023\t      - 'No'\n1024\t    - - DeepSeek-V4-Pro\n1025\t      - '-0.004'\n1026\t      - '0.05'\n1027\t      - '0.01'\n1028\t      - 'No'\n1029\t    - - Qwen3-235B-A22B\n1030\t      - '-0.006'\n1031\t      - '0.05'\n1032\t      - '0.02'\n1033\t      - 'No'\n1034\t    - - Qwen3.6-27B\n1035\t      - '-0.009'\n1036\t      - '0.08'\n1037\t      - '0.03'\n1038\t      - 'No'\n1039\t    - - Llama 4 Maverick\n1040\t      - '-0.005'\n1041\t      - '0.04'\n1042\t      - '0.02'\n1043\t      - 'No'\n1044\t    - - Gemini 2.5 Pro\n1045\t      - '-0.004'\n1046\t      - '0.04'\n1047\t      - '0.01'\n1048\t      - 'No'\n1049\t  figures_description:\n1050\t  - 'Figure: Judge count sensitivity curve — x-axis: N judges, y-axis: Kendall-τ.\n1051\t    Lines for G-MFRM, MFRM, UDA, raw average. G-MFRM crosses MFRM at N=2, crosses\n1052\t    UDA at N=6. Shaded region: convergence failure zone (N<3).'\n1053\t  - 'Figure: Leave-one-judge-out stability plot — 8 bars showing τ when each judge\n1054\t    is removed. Error bars from bootstrap. No single judge removal causes >0.01 τ\n1055\t    change.'\n1056\t  analysis: '结果为论文 Limitations 提供了具体指导：G-MFRM 在 4+ judges 时仍优于 sequential baseline，\n1057\t    在 6+ judges 时优于 best baseline (UDA)，在 2 judges 时 gracefully degrades 到 MFRM 水平。\n1058\t    这为 practitioners 提供了明确的 cost-benefit guidance：如果只能负担 4 judges，G-MFRM 仍有 contamination\n1059\t    correction 价值但不优于 UDA；6+ judges 是推荐最小配置。Leave-one-out 分析 确认了 8-judge pool 的鲁棒性——没有单个\n1060\t    judge 是不可替代的，也没有 judge 表现出 preference leakage pattern。\n1061\t\n1062\t    '\n1063\t- name: exposure_indicator_ablation\n1064\t  plan_id: exp-007\n1065\t  description: 'Ablation of each exposure indicator''s contribution to e_i estimation\n1066\t    quality. Leave-one-out analysis of performance gap, temporal signal, and LogProber.\n1067\t\n1068\t    '\n1069\t  expected_results:\n1070\t    full_pipeline_tau: 0.87\n1071\t    ablate_logprober_tau: 0.855\n1072\t    ablate_temporal_tau: 0.86\n1073\t    ablate_performance_gap_tau: 0.83\n1074\t    performance_gap_only_tau: 0.855\n1075\t    temporal_only_tau: 0.81\n1076\t    logprober_only_tau: 0.825\n1077\t    ei_internal_consistency_full: 0.68\n1078\t    ei_internal_consistency_no_logprober: 0.63\n1079\t    ei_internal_consistency_no_temporal: 0.65\n1080\t    ei_internal_consistency_no_perfgap: 0.48\n1081\t    cn_recovery_corr_full: 0.72\n1082\t    cn_recovery_corr_no_logprober: 0.67\n1083\t    cn_recovery_corr_no_temporal: 0.69\n1084\t    cn_recovery_corr_no_perfgap: 0.53\n1085\t  result_rationale: 'Performance gap 是 e_i 估计的主信号 (权重 0.55)，移除它导致最大性能下降 (τ: 0.87 →\n1086\t    0.83, Δ = −0.04)。这是因为 performance gap 是唯一直接度量 item-level contamination effect\n1087\t    的指标—— 通过比较模型在原始 vs 改写 items 上的表现差异，直接反映了 memorization 的程度。Temporal 和 LogProber\n1088\t    各自只捕捉 contamination 的间接信号 (时间先后、token logprob)。移除 LogProber 的影响较小 (Δτ = −0.015)，因为它只覆盖\n1089\t    45% 的模型，但对覆盖到的模型提供了高精度信号。 移除 temporal signal 影响更小 (Δτ = −0.010)，因为它的噪声最大但提供了广覆盖的\n1090\t    baseline 信号。关键发现：即使 performance gap only (τ = 0.855)，G-MFRM 仍然优于 all baselines\n1091\t    except UDA (0.82)——这意味着 paper 的主结果不依赖于 LogProber 或 temporal signal 的 可用性，降低了方法的\n1092\t    adoption barrier。\n1093\t\n1094\t    '\n1095\t  tables:\n1096\t  - name: 'Table: Exposure Indicator Ablation'\n1097\t    columns:\n1098\t    - Configuration\n1099\t    - e_i Consistency (α)\n1100\t    - c_n ConStat Corr\n1101\t    - G-MFRM τ\n1102\t    - Δτ vs Full\n1103\t    rows:\n1104\t    - - Full pipeline (all 3)\n1105\t      - '0.68'\n1106\t      - '0.72'\n1107\t      - '0.870'\n1108\t      - ref\n1109\t    - - −LogProber\n1110\t      - '0.63'\n1111\t      - '0.67'\n1112\t      - '0.855'\n1113\t      - −0.015\n1114\t    - - −Temporal\n1115\t      - '0.65'\n1116\t      - '0.69'\n1117\t      - '0.860'\n1118\t      - −0.010\n1119\t    - - −Performance Gap\n1120\t      - '0.48'\n1121\t      - '0.53'\n1122\t      - '0.830'\n1123\t      - −0.040\n1124\t    - - Performance Gap only\n1125\t      - '0.58'\n1126\t      - '0.64'\n1127\t      - '0.855'\n1128\t      - −0.015\n1129\t    - - Temporal only\n1130\t      - '0.41'\n1131\t      - '0.48'\n1132\t      - '0.810'\n1133\t      - −0.060\n1134\t    - - LogProber only\n1135\t      - '0.52'\n1136\t      - '0.57'\n1137\t      - '0.825'\n1138\t      - −0.045\n1139\t  figures_description:\n1140\t  - 'Figure: Ablation waterfall chart — starting from full pipeline τ=0.87, showing\n1141\t    marginal contribution of each component. Performance gap contributes most (~60%\n1142\t    of total improvement over no-exposure baseline).'\n1143\t  - 'Figure: e_i scatter — full pipeline e_i vs performance-gap-only e_i. High correlation\n1144\t    (r=0.89) but temporal/LogProber provide refinement in mid-range exposure items.'\n1145\t  analysis: 'Ablation 确认 performance gap 是核心信号，但三源组合比任何单一信号更好。对 paper 的意义： (1) 方法的最小可行版本只需要\n1146\t    reference variant construction (performance gap)，降低 adoption barrier；(2) LogProber\n1147\t    和 temporal signal 提供增量改善，值得使用但不是 required； (3) 论文中可以将 performance gap 作为 primary\n1148\t    method 呈现，其余两个作为 supplementary indicators。这也解释了为什么 exp-012 中 e_i noise σ=0.2 时\n1149\t    G-MFRM 仍然 robust—— 即使 secondary signals 有噪声，primary signal 足够稳定。\n1150\t\n1151\t    '\n1152\t- name: facet_fit_diagnostics\n1153\t  plan_id: exp-008\n1154\t  description: 'Measurement quality validation: infit/outfit MNSQ for all facets,\n1155\t    divergent transition count, posterior predictive check, trace plots.\n1156\t\n1157\t    '\n1158\t  expected_results:\n1159\t    theta_infit_mnsq_range:\n1160\t    - 0.82\n1161\t    - 1.18\n1162\t    theta_outfit_mnsq_range:\n1163\t    - 0.78\n1164\t    - 1.25\n1165\t    theta_misfit_count: 1\n1166\t    b_infit_mnsq_range:\n1167\t    - 0.75\n1168\t    - 1.3\n1169\t    b_outfit_mnsq_range:\n1170\t    - 0.7\n1171\t    - 1.42\n1172\t    b_misfit_count: 18\n1173\t    d_infit_mnsq_range:\n1174\t    - 0.85\n1175\t    - 1.15\n1176\t    d_outfit_mnsq_range:\n1177\t    - 0.8\n1178\t    - 1.2\n1179\t    d_misfit_count: 0\n1180\t    c_infit_mnsq_range:\n1181\t    - 0.78\n1182\t    - 1.22\n1183\t    c_outfit_mnsq_range:\n1184\t    - 0.72\n1185\t    - 1.35\n1186\t    c_misfit_count: 2\n1187\t    divergent_transitions: 0\n1188\t    ppc_p_value: 0.38\n1189\t    ppc_dof_corrected: true\n1190\t    lz_vs_cn_correlation: 0.52\n1191\t    emri_vs_cn_correlation: 0.48\n1192\t    stage1_vs_stage3_theta_corr: 0.96\n1193\t    flagged_items_outfit_gt_2: 3\n1194\t  result_rationale: 'Best 档假设 G-MFRM converges cleanly (R̂ ≤ 1.05, ESS ≥ 150)，facet\n1195\t    fit diagnostics 是 这个假设的延伸验证。θ facet 的 infit/outfit MNSQ 在 [0.82, 1.18] / [0.78,\n1196\t    1.25] 范围， 完全在可接受范围 [0.5, 1.5] (Linacre 2002) 内，仅 1 个模型 misfit (可能是 Jamba 2—— 其能力\n1197\t    profile 与 Rasch 假设的单维度结构最不一致)。b facet 有 18 个 misfit items (580 items 中的 3.1%)，这是正常水平——MT-Bench\n1198\t    coding items 倾向于 outfit > 1.3 因为 它们更 \"all-or-nothing\" (不符合 Rasch 的渐进概率假设)。d facet\n1199\t    0 个 misfit 表明 8 judges 的 severity 结构清晰。c facet 有 2 个 misfit models，可能是训练数据包含 partial\n1200\t    benchmark overlap 的模型 (rank-1 c_n·e_i 假设对它们近似较差)。零 divergent transitions 确认 NUTS\n1201\t    sampler 在这个模型上工作良好。PPC p = 0.38 表明模型对数据 的拟合在可接受范围 (p < 0.05 才报警)。lz vs c_n 的 corr\n1202\t    = 0.52 表明 person-fit residual 和 contamination susceptibility 有中等相关——高 c_n 模型确实表现出更多\n1203\t    model-data misfit，因为 contamination 造成的 performance inflation 产生了看似 inconsistent\n1204\t    的 response pattern。\n1205\t\n1206\t    '\n1207\t  tables:\n1208\t  - name: 'Table: Facet Fit Summary (Infit/Outfit MNSQ)'\n1209\t    columns:\n1210\t    - Facet\n1211\t    - N\n1212\t    - Infit Range\n1213\t    - Outfit Range\n1214\t    - Misfit Count\n1215\t    - Misfit %\n1216\t    rows:\n1217\t    - - θ (model ability)\n1218\t      - '22'\n1219\t      - '[0.82, 1.18]'\n1220\t      - '[0.78, 1.25]'\n1221\t      - '1'\n1222\t      - 4.5%\n1223\t    - - b (item difficulty)\n1224\t      - '580'\n1225\t      - '[0.75, 1.30]'\n1226\t      - '[0.70, 1.42]'\n1227\t      - '18'\n1228\t      - 3.1%\n1229\t    - - d (judge severity)\n1230\t      - '8'\n1231\t      - '[0.85, 1.15]'\n1232\t      - '[0.80, 1.20]'\n1233\t      - '0'\n1234\t      - 0%\n1235\t    - - c (contamination)\n1236\t      - '22'\n1237\t      - '[0.78, 1.22]'\n1238\t      - '[0.72, 1.35]'\n1239\t      - '2'\n1240\t      - 9.1%\n1241\t  - name: 'Table: MCMC Diagnostic Summary'\n1242\t    columns:\n1243\t    - Diagnostic\n1244\t    - Value\n1245\t    - Threshold\n1246\t    - Status\n1247\t    rows:\n1248\t    - - R-hat max (all params)\n1249\t      - '1.03'\n1250\t      - ≤ 1.05\n1251\t      - PASS\n1252\t    - - ESS min (all params)\n1253\t      - '285'\n1254\t      - ≥ 150\n1255\t      - PASS\n1256\t    - - Divergent transitions\n1257\t      - '0'\n1258\t      - '0'\n1259\t      - PASS\n1260\t    - - PPC p-value\n1261\t      - '0.38'\n1262\t      - '> 0.05'\n1263\t      - PASS\n1264\t    - - BFMI (E-BFMI)\n1265\t      - '0.92'\n1266\t      - '> 0.3'\n1267\t      - PASS\n1268\t  - name: 'Table: Person-Fit vs Contamination Correlation'\n1269\t    columns:\n1270\t    - Person-Fit Index\n1271\t    - Corr with c_n\n1272\t    - p-value\n1273\t    - Interpretation\n1274\t    rows:\n1275\t    - - lz (likelihood-based)\n1276\t      - '0.52'\n1277\t      - '0.013'\n1278\t      - 'Moderate: high c_n ↔ response aberrance'\n1279\t    - - EMRi (residual-based)\n1280\t      - '0.48'\n1281\t      - '0.024'\n1282\t      - 'Moderate: contamination creates inconsistent patterns'\n1283\t    - - Stage 1 θ - Stage 3 θ\n1284\t      - '0.61'\n1285\t      - '0.003'\n1286\t      - 'Strong: bias correction proportional to c_n'\n1287\t  figures_description:\n1288\t  - 'Figure: Infit-outfit bubble chart (Wright map) for all 22 models. Bubble size\n1289\t    = c_n. Most models within acceptable zone; 2 high-c_n models near boundary.'\n1290\t  - 'Figure: Posterior predictive check — observed vs predicted score distributions\n1291\t    by judge and by model. Overlay shows good fit (close to diagonal).'\n1292\t  - 'Figure: Trace plots (4 panels) for representative parameters: θ_GPT-5.5, c_n_GPT-4o,\n1293\t    d_Qwen3.6-27B, b_item42. All show stationary mixing.'\n1294\t  analysis: 'Diagnostics 全面通过，为 G-MFRM 的 measurement quality 提供了坚实证据。关键发现： (1) 所有\n1295\t    MCMC diagnostics PASS，零 divergent transitions 说明 model parameterization 合适； (2)\n1296\t    Item misfit 率 3.1% 在 Rasch 文献的正常范围 (typically 2-5%)，且 misfit items 集中在 coding\n1297\t    category (binary-like responses)——可在 Limitations 中讨论； (3) lz vs c_n 的 moderate\n1298\t    correlation (0.52) 提供了 construct coherence 的 convergent evidence： contamination\n1299\t    确实产生了可被 person-fit 检测到的 response aberrance，且 G-MFRM 的 c_n parameter 正好捕捉了这个效应。这支持了\n1300\t    G-MFRM 不仅是 statistical fitting 而是在捕捉 genuine contamination signal 的论点。\n1301\t\n1302\t    '\n1303\t- name: confounding_formal_observation\n1304\t  plan_id: exp-009\n1305\t  description: 'Derive first-order bias approximation for sequential estimator under\n1306\t    d_j/c_n·e_i non-orthogonality. Monte Carlo validation + synthetic c_n point-estimate\n1307\t    validation.\n1308\t\n1309\t    '\n1310\t  expected_results:\n1311\t    bias_approximation_validated: true\n1312\t    monte_carlo_replications: 1000\n1313\t    bias_direction_correct_pct: 0.97\n1314\t    first_order_bias_magnitude_mean: 0.18\n1315\t    first_order_bias_magnitude_std: 0.06\n1316\t    second_order_correction_improvement: 0.12\n1317\t    cn_point_estimate_rmse: 0.48\n1318\t    cn_95ci_coverage: 0.91\n1319\t    cn_corr_with_truth: 0.88\n1320\t    rho_range_tested:\n1321\t    - 0.0\n1322\t    - 0.8\n1323\t    bias_at_rho_0: 0.003\n1324\t    bias_at_rho_0_3: 0.052\n1325\t    bias_at_rho_0_6: 0.141\n1326\t    bias_at_rho_0_8: 0.248\n1327\t    theta_rmse_sequential_vs_joint_rho_0_6: 0.33\n1328\t  result_rationale: 'Best 档假设 confounding scatter r ≥ 0.4，即 d_j 和 c_n·e_i 在真实数据上 empirically\n1329\t    non-orthogonal。Monte Carlo 验证 first-order OVB approximation：在 1000 replications\n1330\t    中， 97% 的情况下 sequential estimator 的 bias 方向与理论预测一致 (high c_n → overestimate θ)。\n1331\t    Bias 随 ρ(d,c·e) 单调递增：ρ=0 时几乎无 bias (0.003，数值噪声)，ρ=0.3 时 bias = 0.052 (对应 mvp_001\n1332\t    接近失败的区域)，ρ=0.6 时 bias = 0.141 (对应 best 档的真实数据区域)， ρ=0.8 时 bias = 0.248 (极端但可能的情景)。c_n\n1333\t    点估计 RMSE = 0.48，95% CI coverage = 0.91 (接近 nominal 0.95)，c_n 与真值相关 0.88——确认 G-MFRM\n1334\t    的 Stage 3 不仅能 correct θ 还能 recover underlying c_n signal with reasonable accuracy。CI\n1335\t    略 under-coverage (0.91 vs 0.95) 可能因 Stage 2→3 的 error propagation 未完全被 posterior\n1336\t    捕捉，可引用 exp-012 的 sensitivity analysis 作为补充讨论。\n1337\t\n1338\t    '\n1339\t  tables:\n1340\t  - name: 'Table: Monte Carlo OVB Validation'\n1341\t    columns:\n1342\t    - ρ(d, c·e)\n1343\t    - N Reps\n1344\t    - Mean Bias(θ_seq)\n1345\t    - SD Bias\n1346\t    - Bias Direction Correct %\n1347\t    - Joint RMSE\n1348\t    - Seq RMSE\n1349\t    - RMSE Reduction\n1350\t    rows:\n1351\t    - - '0.0'\n1352\t      - '1000'\n1353\t      - '0.003'\n1354\t      - '0.018'\n1355\t      - 52%\n1356\t      - '0.128'\n1357\t      - '0.129'\n1358\t      - 0.8%\n1359\t    - - '0.2'\n1360\t      - '1000'\n1361\t      - '0.031'\n1362\t      - '0.024'\n1363\t      - 83%\n1364\t      - '0.130'\n1365\t      - '0.138'\n1366\t      - 5.8%\n1367\t    - - '0.3'\n1368\t      - '1000'\n1369\t      - '0.052'\n1370\t      - '0.029'\n1371\t      - 91%\n1372\t      - '0.131'\n1373\t      - '0.152'\n1374\t      - 13.8%\n1375\t    - - '0.4'\n1376\t      - '1000'\n1377\t      - '0.082'\n1378\t      - '0.035'\n1379\t      - 95%\n1380\t      - '0.132'\n1381\t      - '0.171'\n1382\t      - 22.8%\n1383\t    - - '0.6'\n1384\t      - '1000'\n1385\t      - '0.141'\n1386\t      - '0.048'\n1387\t      - 97%\n1388\t      - '0.134'\n1389\t      - '0.213'\n1390\t      - 37.1%\n1391\t    - - '0.8'\n1392\t      - '1000'\n1393\t      - '0.248'\n1394\t      - '0.067'\n1395\t      - 99%\n1396\t      - '0.137'\n1397\t      - '0.302'\n1398\t      - 54.6%\n1399\t  - name: 'Table: Synthetic c_n Recovery Accuracy'\n1400\t    columns:\n1401\t    - Metric\n1402\t    - Value\n1403\t    - Threshold\n1404\t    - Status\n1405\t    rows:\n1406\t    - - c_n RMSE (vs ground truth)\n1407\t      - '0.48'\n1408\t      - < 0.80\n1409\t      - PASS\n1410\t    - - c_n correlation with truth\n1411\t      - '0.88'\n1412\t      - '> 0.70'\n1413\t      - PASS\n1414\t    - - 95% CI coverage probability\n1415\t      - '0.91'\n1416\t      - ≈ 0.95\n1417\t      - Slight under-coverage\n1418\t    - - Mean c_n bias\n1419\t      - '+0.05'\n1420\t      - < |0.20|\n1421\t      - PASS\n1422\t    - - c_n rank-order Kendall-τ with truth\n1423\t      - '0.85'\n1424\t      - '> 0.70'\n1425\t      - PASS\n1426\t  figures_description:\n1427\t  - 'Figure: Bias vs ρ curve — x-axis: non-orthogonality ρ(d,c·e), y-axis: mean |bias(θ_seq)|.\n1428\t    Solid line = Monte Carlo mean, shaded = 95% envelope. Dashed line = first-order\n1429\t    approximation. Close match up to ρ≈0.6, slight divergence at ρ>0.7 (higher-order\n1430\t    terms).'\n1431\t  - 'Figure: c_n recovery scatter — fitted c_n vs true c_n (one dot per model, 20\n1432\t    models × 50 reps). Tight cluster around diagonal, slight upward bias for very\n1433\t    high c_n.'\n1434\t  - 'Figure: Sequential bias direction illustration — arrows showing how high c_n\n1435\t    models get pushed right (θ overestimated) and low c_n models get pushed left (θ\n1436\t    underestimated) under sequential estimation.'\n1437\t  analysis: 'Formal observation 在 Monte Carlo 验证中得到完全确认。First-order OVB approximation\n1438\t    在 ρ ≤ 0.6 范围内准确 (与 Monte Carlo 偏差 < 5%)，在更高 ρ 时 higher-order terms 变得 重要但 bias\n1439\t    direction 仍然正确 (99%)。这为 paper Section 2 提供了坚实的理论基础： sequential estimation 不是 \"slightly\n1440\t    suboptimal\"，而是在 non-orthogonal 情况下 systematically biased，bias 方向和大小可预测。c_n recovery\n1441\t    的成功 (RMSE=0.48, corr=0.88) 直接回应 Dream R1-N3：G-MFRM 不仅能 correct rankings，还能产生有意义的\n1442\t    per-model contamination estimates。95% CI 的轻微 under-coverage 是 staged estimation\n1443\t    的已知代价， 可与 exp-012 的 error propagation 结果交叉引用。\n1444\t\n1445\t    '\n1446\t- name: wildbench_replication\n1447\t  plan_id: exp-010\n1448\t  description: 'Replicate G-MFRM pipeline on WildBench as third benchmark. Cross-benchmark\n1449\t    generalization test.\n1450\t\n1451\t    '\n1452\t  expected_results:\n1453\t    wildbench_items: 1024\n1454\t    wildbench_judges: 8\n1455\t    wildbench_models: 22\n1456\t    kendall_tau_gmfrm_wildbench: 0.84\n1457\t    kendall_tau_raw_average_wildbench: 0.74\n1458\t    kendall_tau_best_baseline_wildbench: 0.79\n1459\t    delta_tau_gmfrm_vs_best_baseline: 0.05\n1460\t    delta_tau_p_value: 0.012\n1461\t    cn_median_wildbench: 0.68\n1462\t    cn_corr_with_mt_bench_cn: 0.82\n1463\t    ei_mean_wildbench: 0.38\n1464\t    rhat_max: 1.04\n1465\t    ess_min: 195\n1466\t    cross_benchmark_cn_consistency: 0.78\n1467\t  result_rationale: 'WildBench (2024-05 release, 1024 items from real user queries)\n1468\t    是比 MT-Bench 和 Arena-Hard 更 diverse 的 benchmark，但 contamination level 预期较低 (median\n1469\t    c_n = 0.68)，因为： (1) 更新，训练数据覆盖率更低；(2) items 来自 real user queries 而非人工设计，更难被 memorized；(3)\n1470\t    items 更多更多样，降低了每个 item 被特定训练的概率。τ = 0.84 低于 MT-Bench + Arena-Hard combined (0.87)，反映了\n1471\t    WildBench 的 contamination 更低 (joint vs sequential 的优势随 contamination 降低而缩小)。但\n1472\t    Δτ = +0.05 vs best baseline 仍然 显著 (p = 0.012)，确认 G-MFRM 的优势 generalizes across\n1473\t    benchmarks。c_n 跨 benchmark 相关 0.82 表明 per-model contamination susceptibility 是\n1474\t    model-level trait (不依赖于 specific benchmark)——这是有意义的方法论发现。收敛略差 (R̂ = 1.04, ESS\n1475\t    = 195) 因为 WildBench items 更多样，Rasch 单维度假设拟合度稍差，但仍在可接受范围内。\n1476\t\n1477\t    '\n1478\t  tables:\n1479\t  - name: 'Table: Cross-Benchmark Generalization'\n1480\t    columns:\n1481\t    - Benchmark\n1482\t    - N Items\n1483\t    - G-MFRM τ\n1484\t    - Best Baseline τ\n1485\t    - Δτ\n1486\t    - p-value\n1487\t    - c_n Median\n1488\t    rows:\n1489\t    - - MT-Bench\n1490\t      - '80'\n1491\t      - '0.880'\n1492\t      - '0.830'\n1493\t      - '+0.050'\n1494\t      - '0.015'\n1495\t      - '1.25'\n1496\t    - - Arena-Hard\n1497\t      - '500'\n1498\t      - '0.860'\n1499\t      - '0.810'\n1500\t      - '+0.050'\n1501\t      - '0.010'\n1502\t      - '0.78'\n1503\t    - - WildBench\n1504\t      - '1024'\n1505\t      - '0.840'\n1506\t      - '0.790'\n1507\t      - '+0.050'\n1508\t      - '0.012'\n1509\t      - '0.68'\n1510\t    - - Combined (all 3)\n1511\t      - '1604'\n1512\t      - '0.870'\n1513\t      - '0.820'\n1514\t      - '+0.050'\n1515\t      - '0.003'\n1516\t      - '0.82'\n1517\t  figures_description:\n1518\t  - 'Figure: Cross-benchmark τ comparison grouped bar chart. Three benchmark clusters\n1519\t    + combined. G-MFRM consistently above baselines, advantage inversely proportional\n1520\t    to benchmark age/exposure.'\n1521\t  - 'Figure: c_n cross-benchmark scatter — MT-Bench c_n vs WildBench c_n per model.\n1522\t    High correlation (r=0.82) confirms contamination susceptibility is a stable model-level\n1523\t    property.'\n1524\t  analysis: 'WildBench replication 确认 G-MFRM 优势 generalizes across benchmarks。最重要的发现是\n1525\t    跨 benchmark c_n 一致性 (r = 0.82)——同一个模型在不同 benchmarks 上的 contamination susceptibility\n1526\t    高度相关，这为 c_n 作为 \"模型级 contamination trait\" 的解释提供了 empirical support。Δτ = +0.05 在三个\n1527\t    benchmarks 上高度一致，说明 G-MFRM 的改善 不是 benchmark-specific artifact。WildBench 的较低 contamination\n1528\t    (median 0.68) 导致 较低的绝对 τ 但 Δτ 保持稳定——这支持了 best 档的叙事：即使在 moderate contamination\n1529\t    场景下，joint estimation 仍有显著价值。\n1530\t\n1531\t    '\n1532\t- name: adversarial_robustness\n1533\t  plan_id: exp-011\n1534\t  description: 'Test G-MFRM robustness against adversarial contamination following\n1535\t    Wang et al. (ICLR 2026) fragility findings.\n1536\t\n1537\t    '\n1538\t  expected_results:\n1539\t    adversarial_attack_types_tested: 3\n1540\t    attack_1_name: answer_injection (direct benchmark answer insertion)\n1541\t    attack_1_cn_detection_rate: 0.85\n1542\t    attack_1_tau_gmfrm: 0.83\n1543\t    attack_1_tau_raw: 0.65\n1544\t    attack_2_name: style_mimicry (benchmark-style response training)\n1545\t    attack_2_cn_detection_rate: 0.72\n1546\t    attack_2_tau_gmfrm: 0.82\n1547\t    attack_2_tau_raw: 0.7\n1548\t    attack_3_name: selective_memorization (memorize only high-weight items)\n1549\t    attack_3_cn_detection_rate: 0.61\n1550\t    attack_3_tau_gmfrm: 0.8\n1551\t    attack_3_tau_raw: 0.68\n1552\t    overall_robustness_score: 0.82\n1553\t    rank_manipulation_success_rate_without_gmfrm: 0.73\n1554\t    rank_manipulation_success_rate_with_gmfrm: 0.28\n1555\t  result_rationale: 'Best 档下 G-MFRM 对 adversarial contamination 展现出中等-强鲁棒性。Answer\n1556\t    injection (最粗暴的攻击) 检测率最高 (0.85)，因为它产生最大的 performance gap (original vs reference)\n1557\t    和最明显的 item-level anomaly pattern。Style mimicry (更隐蔽) 检测率降至 0.72，因为 它不产生 item-specific\n1558\t    memorization 而是 general style transfer，c_n·e_i 的 rank-1 结构对此的拟合度较差。Selective memorization\n1559\t    (最危险) 检测率最低 (0.61)，因为攻击者 选择性地 memorize high-weight items，产生的 pattern 与 legitimate\n1560\t    ability 更相似。 但即使在最差情况下 (attack 3)，G-MFRM (τ = 0.80) 仍优于 raw average (τ = 0.68)。\n1561\t    Rank manipulation success rate 从 without-G-MFRM 的 73% 降至 with-G-MFRM 的 28%—— G-MFRM\n1562\t    使 adversarial ranking gaming 变得 substantially harder。这个实验主要为 Discussion section\n1563\t    提供 material，不是 main contribution 但强化了 practical impact。\n1564\t\n1565\t    '\n1566\t  tables:\n1567\t  - name: 'Table: Adversarial Robustness Summary'\n1568\t    columns:\n1569\t    - Attack Type\n1570\t    - Detection Rate\n1571\t    - G-MFRM τ\n1572\t    - Raw τ\n1573\t    - τ Recovery %\n1574\t    - Rank Manip. Blocked\n1575\t    rows:\n1576\t    - - No attack (baseline)\n1577\t      - N/A\n1578\t      - '0.87'\n1579\t      - '0.76'\n1580\t      - 100%\n1581\t      - N/A\n1582\t    - - Answer injection\n1583\t      - '0.85'\n1584\t      - '0.83'\n1585\t      - '0.65'\n1586\t      - 95%\n1587\t      - 78%\n1588\t    - - Style mimicry\n1589\t      - '0.72'\n1590\t      - '0.82'\n1591\t      - '0.70'\n1592\t      - 94%\n1593\t      - 65%\n1594\t    - - Selective memorization\n1595\t      - '0.61'\n1596\t      - '0.80'\n1597\t      - '0.68'\n1598\t      - 92%\n1599\t      - 52%\n1600\t  figures_description:\n1601\t  - 'Figure: Adversarial robustness radar chart — axes: detection rate, τ preservation,\n1602\t    rank stability, c_n accuracy, convergence quality. G-MFRM polygon substantially\n1603\t    larger than raw baseline across all attacks.'\n1604\t  - 'Figure: Attack severity vs detection rate curve — as attack becomes more sophisticated,\n1605\t    detection drops but G-MFRM still maintains significant advantage over unprotected\n1606\t    evaluation.'\n1607\t  analysis: G-MFRM 对 adversarial contamination 的鲁棒性为 paper 的 practical impact 增添重要维度。\n1608\t    核心信息：G-MFRM 不是 foolproof 但 substantially raises the bar for adversarial gaming——\n1609\t    rank manipulation 成功率从 73% 降至 28%。最隐蔽的攻击 (selective memorization) 仍有 39% 逃逸率 (1\n1610\t    - 0.61 detection rate)，这应在 Limitations 中诚实报告。但即使攻击逃逸了 c_n 检测，G-MFRM 的 judge severity\n1611\t    correction (d_j) 仍提供 partial protection。这个结果 支持了 paper 的 broader message：LLM evaluation\n1612\t    需要多维度的 protection，G-MFRM 是 a significant step but not the final answer。\n1613\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"78fb0fb0-9a26-4b0a-9a95-b4189f601ffb","uuid":"74633ff1-5c21-4502-96fb-2dbb0c9e9bbc","timestamp":"2026-05-22T04:53:09.428Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-prod43/projects/gated_mfrm_judge_bias/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260522T041217/best/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: 'Original framing holds at full strength. Joint estimation is\n  methodologically necessary AND empirically superior. Lead with ranking correction\n  magnitude: \"G-MFRM achieves 7pp higher Kendall-τ with Chatbot Arena while providing\n  interpretable contamination diagnostics.\" Real contamination is moderate-to-strong\n  (median c_n ≈ 1.05), validating the mvp_002/003 regime assumptions. Confounding\n  scatter r ≥ 0.4 confirms the OVB mechanism operates on real data. All 3 claims hold\n  at full strength — AAAI main conference positioning confident. No narrative pivot\n  needed. Paper structure follows Tier A: Section 2 opens with OVB observation + toy\n  example showing 33% θ-RMSE degradation, Section 4 presents G-MFRM dominance across\n  both benchmarks, Section 5 ablation shows each component contributes. Headline:\n  \"On MT-Bench and Arena-Hard with 8 LLM judges, G-MFRM fair scores achieve 8.7% higher\n  Kendall-τ with Chatbot Arena human votes than the best sequential baseline.\"\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: multi_judge_data_collection\n  plan_id: exp-001\n  description: 'Collect multi-judge evaluation data on MT-Bench (80 items × 10 categories)\n    and Arena-Hard (500 items) using 8 judges: GPT-5.5, Claude Opus 4.7, Claude Sonnet\n    4.6, DeepSeek-V4-Pro, Qwen3-235B-A22B, Qwen3.6-27B, Llama 4 Maverick, Gemini 2.5\n    Pro. Evaluate 22 target models with position swap. Collect full judge response\n    generations for UDA baseline compatibility.\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    num_judges: 8\n    num_target_models: 22\n    mt_bench_items: 80\n    arena_hard_items: 500\n    total_judgments_mt_bench: 28160\n    total_judgments_arena_hard: 176000\n    api_cost_usd: 820\n    vllm_gpu_hours: 95\n    judge_agreement_fleiss_kappa: 0.42\n    position_bias_rate_mean: 0.14\n    position_bias_rate_std: 0.06\n    missing_data_rate: 0.02\n    judge_response_generation_success_rate: 0.97\n  result_rationale: 'Best 档假设 ≥ 6 judges produce sufficient facet variance for identifiability。8\n    judges 涵盖 4 家厂商 (OpenAI, Anthropic, DeepSeek, Meta/Qwen) 确保 d_j 分布有足够异质性。22 target\n    models 包括已知 高污染 (GPT-4o, Claude 3.5 Sonnet 等训练数据覆盖广的模型) 和低污染 (新发布的 open-weight\n    模型)， 保证 c_n 分布的方差。Fleiss κ ≈ 0.42 (moderate agreement) 是 LLM judge 的典型水平 (Zheng\n    et al. 2023 报告 MT-Bench 上 GPT-4 与人类 agreement ~0.65，但多 judge 间 agreement 会更低)。Position\n    bias 14% ±6% 基于已有文献 (MT-Bench position bias ~10-20%)。缺失率 2% 来自 API timeout 和 vLLM\n    OOM，best 档下 基础设施运行稳定。总评测数量 ~204K judgments 提供充足的统计功效。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Judge Pool Summary'\n    columns:\n    - Judge\n    - Provider\n    - Type\n    - Params\n    - Position Bias %\n    - Mean Score\n    - Score SD\n    rows:\n    - - GPT-5.5\n      - OpenAI\n      - API\n      - ~2T (est.)\n      - '11.2'\n      - '7.83'\n      - '1.42'\n    - - Claude Opus 4.7\n      - Anthropic\n      - API\n      - ~1.5T (est.)\n      - '8.7'\n      - '7.61'\n      - '1.58'\n    - - Claude Sonnet 4.6\n      - Anthropic\n      - API\n      - ~500B (est.)\n      - '13.5'\n      - '7.45'\n      - '1.51'\n    - - DeepSeek-V4-Pro\n      - DeepSeek\n      - API\n      - 671B MoE\n      - '16.1'\n      - '7.29'\n      - '1.63'\n    - - Qwen3-235B-A22B\n      - Alibaba\n      - vLLM\n      - 235B MoE\n      - '18.3'\n      - '7.12'\n      - '1.71'\n    - - Qwen3.6-27B\n      - Alibaba\n      - vLLM\n      - 27B\n      - '19.7'\n      - '6.88'\n      - '1.82'\n    - - Llama 4 Maverick\n      - Meta\n      - vLLM\n      - 400B MoE\n      - '14.6'\n      - '7.35'\n      - '1.55'\n    - - Gemini 2.5 Pro\n      - Google\n      - API\n      - ~1T (est.)\n      - '10.9'\n      - '7.72'\n      - '1.47'\n  - name: 'Table: Target Model Coverage'\n    columns:\n    - Model\n    - Family\n    - Release Date\n    - Expected Contamination Level\n    - Arena Elo (ref)\n    rows:\n    - - GPT-5.5\n      - OpenAI\n      - 2026-03\n      - High\n      - '1382'\n    - - GPT-4o\n      - OpenAI\n      - 2024-05\n      - Very High\n      - '1261'\n    - - Claude Opus 4.7\n      - Anthropic\n      - 2026-04\n      - High\n      - '1375'\n    - - Claude Sonnet 4.6\n      - Anthropic\n      - 2026-02\n      - Moderate-High\n      - '1338'\n    - - Claude 3.5 Sonnet\n      - Anthropic\n      - 2024-06\n      - Very High\n      - '1268'\n    - - Gemini 2.5 Pro\n      - Google\n      - 2026-01\n      - High\n      - '1355'\n    - - DeepSeek-V4-Pro\n      - DeepSeek\n      - 2026-02\n      - Moderate\n      - '1342'\n    - - DeepSeek-V3\n      - DeepSeek\n      - 2024-12\n      - High\n      - '1280'\n    - - Qwen3-235B-A22B\n      - Alibaba\n      - 2025-10\n      - Moderate\n      - '1295'\n    - - Qwen3.6-27B\n      - Alibaba\n      - 2026-03\n      - Low-Moderate\n      - '1245'\n    - - Llama 4 Maverick\n      - Meta\n      - 2025-11\n      - Moderate\n      - '1302'\n    - - Llama 4 Scout\n      - Meta\n      - 2025-11\n      - Moderate\n      - '1275'\n    - - Mistral Large 3\n      - Mistral\n      - 2025-09\n      - Moderate\n      - '1265'\n    - - Mixtral 8x22B v2\n      - Mistral\n      - 2025-07\n      - Moderate-High\n      - '1250'\n    - - Phi-5\n      - Microsoft\n      - 2026-01\n      - Low\n      - '1230'\n    - - Command R+ v2\n      - Cohere\n      - 2025-12\n      - Low\n      - '1225'\n    - - Jamba 2\n      - AI21\n      - 2025-10\n      - Low\n      - '1210'\n    - - Yi-2 Large\n      - 01.AI\n      - 2025-08\n      - Moderate\n      - '1240'\n    - - GPT-4-turbo\n      - OpenAI\n      - 2024-04\n      - Very High\n      - '1248'\n    - - Gemini 1.5 Pro\n      - Google\n      - 2024-05\n      - Very High\n      - '1252'\n    - - Llama 3.1 405B\n      - Meta\n      - 2024-07\n      - High\n      - '1243'\n    - - Claude 3 Opus\n      - Anthropic\n      - 2024-03\n      - Very High\n      - '1232'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure: Judge severity distribution (violin plot of raw scores by judge), showing\n    d_j heterogeneity across 8 judges. Expected pattern: proprietary large models\n    (GPT-5.5, Claude Opus) cluster as lenient scorers (high mean), smaller open-weight\n    models (Qwen3.6-27B) as harsher scorers.'\n  - 'Figure: Inter-judge agreement heatmap (pairwise Cohen''s κ), showing moderate\n    block structure by model family.'\n  analysis: 'Data collection under best 档预期完整且高质量。8 judges 跨 5 家厂商确保 d_j facet 有足够异质性\n    (judge severity SD ≈ 0.4-0.6 in Rasch logits)。22 target models 覆盖从 Very High 到\n    Low contamination 的完整光谱，为 c_n 估计提供必要的方差。Position swap 产生 ~204K 总判断， 远超 MFRM identifiability\n    所需最小观测数 (8 judges × 22 models × 80 items = 14,080 cells， 远大于参数数 22+80+8+22 = 132)。关键检查点：judge\n    response generations 的 97% 成功率 确保 UDA baseline 有足够训练数据。\n\n    '\n- name: item_exposure_estimation\n  plan_id: exp-002\n  description: 'Estimate per-item exposure e_i via three-source weighted composite\n    pipeline on MT-Bench and Arena-Hard items. Primary source: item-level performance\n    gap (original vs GPT-5.5/Claude-rephrased reference variants). Secondary: temporal\n    signal, LogProber memorization scores. ConStat per-model delta as c_n validation.\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    ei_pipeline_internal_consistency: 0.68\n    source_weight_performance_gap: 0.55\n    source_weight_temporal: 0.25\n    source_weight_logprober: 0.2\n    mt_bench_ei_mean: 0.62\n    mt_bench_ei_std: 0.28\n    arena_hard_ei_mean: 0.45\n    arena_hard_ei_std: 0.31\n    mt_bench_high_exposure_items_pct: 0.38\n    arena_hard_high_exposure_items_pct: 0.22\n    reference_variant_quality_validation_score: 0.91\n    cn_constat_validation_corr: 0.72\n    logprober_coverage_pct: 0.45\n    temporal_signal_coverage_pct: 0.6\n    spline_difficulty_correction_r2: 0.78\n  result_rationale: 'Best 档核心假设之一是 e_i estimation pipeline produces coherent signal\n    (internal consistency ≥ 0.5)。 MT-Bench 的 e_i 均值高于 Arena-Hard (0.62 vs 0.45)，因为\n    MT-Bench 发布更早 (2023-06)， 已被大量训练数据覆盖，而 Arena-Hard (2024-04) 相对较新且项目更多样。38% 的 MT-Bench\n    项目 属于 high-exposure (e_i > 0.8)，这些主要集中在 coding 和 math 类别 (训练数据中这些领域的 benchmark\n    overlap 最大)。三个信号源的权重反映其信息量：performance gap 最直接 (权重 0.55)， temporal signal 覆盖面广但噪声较大\n    (0.25)，LogProber 精确但覆盖有限 (0.20，仅 45% 模型有 logprob API)。ConStat validation corr\n    = 0.72 确认 fitted c_n 与外部 contamination 指标一致， 处于 best 档要求的 [0.6, 0.9] 范围中部。Spline\n    difficulty correction R² = 0.78 表明难度校正 有效移除了 performance gap 中的 difficulty confound——否则难题上所有模型表现都差，会被错误\n    标记为低暴露。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Exposure Estimation by MT-Bench Category'\n    columns:\n    - Category\n    - N Items\n    - Mean e_i\n    - SD e_i\n    - High Exposure %\n    - Primary Source Avail\n    - LogProber Avail\n    rows:\n    - - Writing\n      - '10'\n      - '0.71'\n      - '0.22'\n      - 50%\n      - 100%\n      - 45%\n    - - Roleplay\n      - '10'\n      - '0.48'\n      - '0.30'\n      - 20%\n      - 100%\n      - 45%\n    - - Reasoning\n      - '10'\n      - '0.55'\n      - '0.27'\n      - 30%\n      - 100%\n      - 45%\n    - - Math\n      - '10'\n      - '0.82'\n      - '0.18'\n      - 60%\n      - 100%\n      - 45%\n    - - Coding\n      - '10'\n      - '0.85'\n      - '0.15'\n      - 70%\n      - 100%\n      - 45%\n    - - Extraction\n      - '10'\n      - '0.58'\n      - '0.25'\n      - 30%\n      - 100%\n      - 45%\n    - - STEM\n      - '10'\n      - '0.63'\n      - '0.26'\n      - 30%\n      - 100%\n      - 45%\n    - - Humanities\n      - '10'\n      - '0.35'\n      - '0.28'\n      - 10%\n      - 100%\n      - 45%\n  - name: 'Table: Three-Source Ablation (Validation Split)'\n    columns:\n    - Source Combination\n    - Internal Consistency (α)\n    - ConStat c_n Corr\n    - Notes\n    rows:\n    - - All three\n      - '0.68'\n      - '0.72'\n      - Full pipeline\n    - - Performance gap only\n      - '0.58'\n      - '0.64'\n      - Baseline\n    - - Perf gap + temporal\n      - '0.63'\n      - '0.68'\n      - +4pp consistency\n    - - Perf gap + LogProber\n      - '0.65'\n      - '0.70'\n      - +6pp consistency\n    - - Temporal only\n      - '0.41'\n      - '0.48'\n      - Insufficient alone\n    - - LogProber only\n      - '0.52'\n      - '0.57'\n      - Good but sparse\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure: e_i distribution histograms for MT-Bench vs Arena-Hard, showing MT-Bench\n    shifted right (higher exposure). Bimodal structure visible in MT-Bench: coding/math\n    cluster at high e_i, humanities/roleplay cluster at low e_i.'\n  - 'Figure: Scatter plot of e_i (performance gap method) vs LogProber Safe Score\n    for the 45% of models with logprob access. Expected Pearson r ≈ 0.63, confirming\n    convergent validity.'\n  - 'Figure: Spline difficulty correction visualization — raw performance gap vs difficulty-corrected\n    e_i, showing the correction flattens the difficulty confound.'\n  analysis: 'e_i 估计在 best 档下表现良好。MT-Bench 的类别间 e_i 异质性 (coding/math 高, humanities/roleplay\n    低) 与直觉一致，且与 ConStat 外部验证 corr=0.72 互相印证。关键发现是 MT-Bench 项目平均暴露度 显著高于 Arena-Hard，这为后续\n    exp-003 中跨 benchmark 的 contamination magnitude 差异提供解释。 三个信号源的互补性在 ablation 中清晰可见：LogProber\n    虽覆盖有限但对有覆盖的模型提供最精确信号， temporal signal 提供广覆盖但较粗的估计。Difficulty correction 的 R²=0.78\n    确认了未经校正的 performance gap 会产生 ~22% 的系统性偏差（难题被低估暴露度）。\n\n    '\n- name: gmfrm_real_data_fit\n  plan_id: exp-003\n  description: 'Fit G-MFRM three-stage pipeline on real data. Stage 1: MFRM (θ,b,d).\n    Stage 2: e_i from exp-002. Stage 3: Joint gated model with e_i fixed, c_n as latent.\n    Compare fair scores θ̂ with Chatbot Arena Elo.\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    kendall_tau_gmfrm_mt_bench: 0.87\n    kendall_tau_gmfrm_arena_hard: 0.86\n    kendall_tau_gmfrm_combined: 0.87\n    kendall_tau_mfrm_only: 0.8\n    kendall_tau_raw_average: 0.76\n    spearman_rho_gmfrm: 0.93\n    theta_rmse_vs_arena_elo_normalized: 0.089\n    convergence_rhat_max: 1.03\n    convergence_ess_min: 285\n    convergence_divergent_transitions: 0\n    cn_median: 1.05\n    cn_iqr:\n    - 0.52\n    - 1.61\n    cn_range:\n    - 0.08\n    - 2.34\n    num_models_cn_gt_1: 12\n    num_models_cn_lt_0_3: 4\n    dj_range_logits:\n    - -0.82\n    - 0.95\n    dj_sd: 0.48\n    stage1_runtime_seconds: 1200\n    stage3_runtime_seconds: 3800\n    total_runtime_seconds: 5200\n    graceful_degradation_check: 'Arena-Hard subset (low contamination): G-MFRM τ ≈\n      MFRM τ within 0.01'\n  result_rationale: 'Best 档假设 real c_n distribution has median ≥ 0.8。预测 median = 1.05，位于\n    [0.8, 1.5] 范围中部偏下， 反映现实中的 contamination 是 moderate-to-strong 但非极端。这个水平接近 mvp_003\n    的 DGP 设定， 因此合成数据中观察到的 joint vs sequential 优势 (τ +6.3pp, RMSE −43.8%) 可以部分迁移到真实数据。\n    但真实数据的效应量会衰减约 30-40%，因为：(1) 真实 c_n 分布更离散、非均匀；(2) e_i 有估计误差 (exp-012 显示 σ=0.2 时\n    θ-RMSE 仅增加 5.9%)；(3) 真实 d_j 和 c_n·e_i 的非正交性可能低于合成 设定。Kendall-τ = 0.87 高于 MFRM-only\n    的 0.80 (+7pp)，对应真实数据上 contamination correction 的实质性改善。R̂ max = 1.03、ESS min =\n    285 与 mvp_003 收敛质量相当 (mvp_003: R̂=1.03, ESS=224)， 因为真实数据量 (~204K judgments) 远大于\n    MVP 合成数据，MCMC 有更多信息可利用。12/22 模型的 c_n > 1 表明过半模型存在实质性 contamination，支撑 Tier A 叙事。Arena-Hard\n    子集的 graceful degradation (Δτ < 0.01) 确认当 contamination ≈ 0 时 G-MFRM 不损害估计质量。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: G-MFRM Stage 3 Convergence Diagnostics'\n    columns:\n    - Parameter Group\n    - N Params\n    - R-hat Max\n    - R-hat Mean\n    - ESS Min\n    - ESS Median\n    rows:\n    - - θ (model ability)\n      - '22'\n      - '1.02'\n      - '1.005'\n      - '420'\n      - '680'\n    - - b (item difficulty)\n      - '580'\n      - '1.03'\n      - '1.008'\n      - '310'\n      - '550'\n    - - d (judge severity)\n      - '8'\n      - '1.01'\n      - '1.003'\n      - '850'\n      - '1120'\n    - - c (contamination)\n      - '22'\n      - '1.03'\n      - '1.012'\n      - '285'\n      - '480'\n    - - σ_θ (ability SD)\n      - '1'\n      - '1.01'\n      - '1.01'\n      - '780'\n      - '780'\n    - - σ_c (contamination SD)\n      - '1'\n      - '1.02'\n      - '1.02'\n      - '520'\n      - '520'\n  - name: 'Table: Fitted c_n by Model (Top 10 Most Contaminated)'\n    columns:\n    - Model\n    - c_n Posterior Mean\n    - 95% CI\n    - Arena Elo\n    - θ_raw - θ_fair\n    - Rank Change\n    rows:\n    - - GPT-4o\n      - '2.34'\n      - '[1.82, 2.91]'\n      - '1261'\n      - '+0.41'\n      - '-3'\n    - - Claude 3 Opus\n      - '2.12'\n      - '[1.61, 2.68]'\n      - '1232'\n      - '+0.38'\n      - '-4'\n    - - Gemini 1.5 Pro\n      - '1.98'\n      - '[1.48, 2.53]'\n      - '1252'\n      - '+0.35'\n      - '-3'\n    - - GPT-4-turbo\n      - '1.85'\n      - '[1.37, 2.39]'\n      - '1248'\n      - '+0.33'\n      - '-2'\n    - - Claude 3.5 Sonnet\n      - '1.72'\n      - '[1.25, 2.24]'\n      - '1268'\n      - '+0.31'\n      - '-2'\n    - - Llama 3.1 405B\n      - '1.61'\n      - '[1.14, 2.13]'\n      - '1243'\n      - '+0.28'\n      - '-2'\n    - - DeepSeek-V3\n      - '1.45'\n      - '[1.01, 1.95]'\n      - '1280'\n      - '+0.24'\n      - '-1'\n    - - Mixtral 8x22B v2\n      - '1.32'\n      - '[0.88, 1.82]'\n      - '1250'\n      - '+0.22'\n      - '-1'\n    - - GPT-5.5\n      - '1.18'\n      - '[0.78, 1.64]'\n      - '1382'\n      - '+0.18'\n      - '0'\n    - - Yi-2 Large\n      - '1.08'\n      - '[0.67, 1.55]'\n      - '1240'\n      - '+0.17'\n      - '-1'\n  - name: 'Table: Fitted d_j (Judge Severity)'\n    columns:\n    - Judge\n    - d_j (logits)\n    - 95% CI\n    - Interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen3.6-27B\n      - '0.95'\n      - '[0.78, 1.13]'\n      - Most severe\n    - - Qwen3-235B-A22B\n      - '0.62'\n      - '[0.47, 0.78]'\n      - Severe\n    - - DeepSeek-V4-Pro\n      - '0.31'\n      - '[0.18, 0.45]'\n      - Moderate\n    - - Llama 4 Maverick\n      - '0.15'\n      - '[0.02, 0.28]'\n      - Slightly severe\n    - - Claude Sonnet 4.6\n      - '-0.08'\n      - '[-0.21, 0.06]'\n      - Near average\n    - - Gemini 2.5 Pro\n      - '-0.25'\n      - '[-0.39, -0.11]'\n      - Lenient\n    - - Claude Opus 4.7\n      - '-0.48'\n      - '[-0.63, -0.34]'\n      - Lenient\n    - - GPT-5.5\n      - '-0.82'\n      - '[-0.98, -0.67]'\n      - Most lenient\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure: θ_raw vs θ_fair scatter (22 models), with arrows showing rank displacement.\n    High-c_n models (GPT-4o, Claude 3 Opus) shift down; low-c_n models (Phi-5, Command\n    R+) shift up. Arrow length proportional to c_n. Color by contamination tier.'\n  - 'Figure: Posterior c_n violin plots for all 22 models, ordered by posterior mean.\n    Clear separation between high/low contamination groups. Dashed line at c_n = 0.3\n    (negligible contamination threshold).'\n  - 'Figure: Trace plots for 4 representative parameters (θ_GPT-5.5, c_n_GPT-4o, d_GPT-5.5,\n    b_item42). All show good mixing with no trends.'\n  - 'Figure: Per-benchmark G-MFRM τ comparison bar chart — MT-Bench vs Arena-Hard.\n    MT-Bench shows larger G-MFRM advantage (higher contamination), Arena-Hard shows\n    modest advantage.'\n  analysis: 'G-MFRM 在真实数据上的表现完全支撑 Tier A 叙事。核心发现：(1) c_n median = 1.05 确认现实 contamination\n    处于 moderate-to-strong 范围，与 mvp_002/003 假设一致；(2) 12/22 模型 c_n > 1， old-generation\n    模型 (GPT-4o, Claude 3 Opus, Gemini 1.5 Pro) 污染最重，符合直觉——这些模型 训练数据更可能包含 MT-Bench/Arena-Hard\n    原始题目；(3) 收敛质量优良 (R̂ ≤ 1.03, ESS ≥ 285)， 与 mvp_003 可比；(4) Arena-Hard 上 G-MFRM 优势略小，因为该\n    benchmark 更新、暴露度更低， 这恰好验证了 graceful degradation——当 contamination 低时，G-MFRM 不做有害调整。\n    Judge severity 的分布符合预期：smaller open-weight models 更严格，大型 proprietary models 更宽松。\n\n    '\n- name: baseline_comparison\n  plan_id: exp-004\n  description: 'Compare G-MFRM against 8 baselines on same data. Metrics: Kendall-τ,\n    Spearman-ρ with Chatbot Arena. Include rank change analysis and post-hoc power\n    analysis.\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    kendall_tau_raw_average: 0.76\n    kendall_tau_mfrm_only: 0.8\n    kendall_tau_sequential_bias_first: 0.79\n    kendall_tau_sequential_contam_first: 0.78\n    kendall_tau_cyclicjudge: 0.81\n    kendall_tau_cyclicjudge_discard: 0.8\n    kendall_tau_dcr: 0.77\n    kendall_tau_uda: 0.82\n    kendall_tau_prefleak: 0.79\n    kendall_tau_gmfrm: 0.87\n    delta_tau_vs_best_baseline: 0.05\n    best_baseline_name: UDA\n    delta_tau_p_value_wilcoxon: 0.008\n    spearman_rho_gmfrm: 0.93\n    spearman_rho_best_baseline: 0.88\n    rank_change_top5_stability_gmfrm: 0.9\n    rank_change_top5_stability_raw: 0.7\n    rank_change_max_displacement: 4\n    rank_change_mean_displacement: 1.6\n    post_hoc_power_at_observed_delta: 0.86\n    n_models: 22\n  result_rationale: 'Best 档要求 delta_tau_vs_best_baseline ∈ [0.04, 0.10] 且 p ∈ [0.001,\n    0.03]。预测 Δτ = 0.05, p = 0.008。UDA 是最强 baseline (τ = 0.82)，因为它通过 neural K-factor\n    调整隐式捕捉了部分 judge-item interaction，但它是 black-box 且 contamination-unaware，因此在高污染模型上仍会\n    overestimate ability。CyclicJudge (τ = 0.81) 次之，round-robin 消除了 average judge bias\n    但无法处理 item-specific judge effects 和 contamination。Sequential pipeline 表现差于 MFRM-only\n    和 CyclicJudge，因为 OVB 导致第一阶段的偏差传递到第二阶段——这直接支持 Claim 1 (confounding claim)。DCR (τ\n    = 0.77) 仅调整 contamination 不调整 judge bias，因此效果有限。 Post-hoc power = 0.86 > 0.80\n    阈值，22 models 提供足够的统计功效检测 Δτ = 0.05。 Top-5 stability 从 raw 的 0.70 提升到 G-MFRM 的\n    0.90，表明 contamination correction 主要影响 mid-tier 模型的排名，top models 的相对顺序更稳定但绝对位置有调整。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Main Result — Method Comparison (Combined MT-Bench + Arena-Hard)'\n    columns:\n    - Method\n    - Kendall-τ\n    - Spearman-ρ\n    - Mean Rank Δ\n    - Bias-Aware?\n    - Contam-Aware?\n    rows:\n    - - Raw Multi-Judge Average\n      - '0.760'\n      - '0.842'\n      - ref\n      - 'No'\n      - 'No'\n    - - MFRM-only\n      - '0.800'\n      - '0.871'\n      - '1.2'\n      - 'Yes'\n      - 'No'\n    - - Sequential (bias→contam)\n      - '0.790'\n      - '0.863'\n      - '1.8'\n      - Partial\n      - Partial\n    - - Sequential (contam→bias)\n      - '0.780'\n      - '0.855'\n      - '2.1'\n      - Partial\n      - Partial\n    - - CyclicJudge\n      - '0.810'\n      - '0.878'\n      - '1.0'\n      - 'Yes'\n      - 'No'\n    - - CyclicJudge + Item Discard\n      - '0.800'\n      - '0.870'\n      - '1.1'\n      - 'Yes'\n      - Partial\n    - - DCR Factor\n      - '0.770'\n      - '0.848'\n      - '0.8'\n      - 'No'\n      - 'Yes'\n    - - UDA\n      - '0.820'\n      - '0.885'\n      - '1.3'\n      - Yes (implicit)\n      - 'No'\n    - - Preference Leakage Calib.\n      - '0.790'\n      - '0.862'\n      - '0.9'\n      - Partial\n      - 'No'\n    - - G-MFRM (ours)\n      - '**0.870**'\n      - '**0.930**'\n      - '**1.6**'\n      - 'Yes'\n      - 'Yes'\n  - name: 'Table: Rank Change Analysis — Models with Largest Displacement'\n    columns:\n    - Model\n    - Raw Rank\n    - G-MFRM Rank\n    - Displacement\n    - c_n\n    - Direction\n    rows:\n    - - Claude 3 Opus\n      - '8'\n      - '12'\n      - '-4'\n      - '2.12'\n      - Overestimated → corrected down\n    - - GPT-4o\n      - '10'\n      - '13'\n      - '-3'\n      - '2.34'\n      - Overestimated → corrected down\n    - - Gemini 1.5 Pro\n      - '9'\n      - '12'\n      - '-3'\n      - '1.98'\n      - Overestimated → corrected down\n    - - Phi-5\n      - '18'\n      - '15'\n      - '+3'\n      - '0.15'\n      - Underestimated → corrected up\n    - - Command R+ v2\n      - '20'\n      - '17'\n      - '+3'\n      - '0.12'\n      - Underestimated → corrected up\n    - - GPT-4-turbo\n      - '12'\n      - '14'\n      - '-2'\n      - '1.85'\n      - Overestimated → corrected down\n  - name: 'Table: Post-hoc Power Analysis'\n    columns:\n    - Comparison\n    - Observed Δτ\n    - N\n    - Power (α=0.05)\n    - Min N for Power=0.80\n    rows:\n    - - G-MFRM vs UDA\n      - '0.05'\n      - '22'\n      - '0.86'\n      - '18'\n    - - G-MFRM vs CyclicJudge\n      - '0.06'\n      - '22'\n      - '0.91'\n      - '15'\n    - - G-MFRM vs Sequential\n      - '0.08'\n      - '22'\n      - '0.97'\n      - '10'\n    - - G-MFRM vs Raw\n      - '0.11'\n      - '22'\n      - '0.99'\n      - '8'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure: Bar chart of Kendall-τ for all 9 methods, with 95% bootstrap CI. G-MFRM\n    bar clearly separated from cluster of baselines. Error bars non-overlapping with\n    best baseline (UDA).'\n  - 'Figure: Rank displacement plot — each model is a horizontal arrow from raw rank\n    to G-MFRM rank. Arrow color by c_n magnitude. High-c_n models shift right (rank\n    worsens), low-c_n models shift left (rank improves).'\n  - 'Figure: Top-k stability curve (k = 3, 5, 10, 15, 20) for Raw, MFRM, UDA, and\n    G-MFRM. G-MFRM dominates at all k, largest gap at k=10.'\n  analysis: 'G-MFRM 在所有指标上显著超越全部 8 个 baseline，Δτ = +0.05 vs UDA (p = 0.008)。结果的 核心模式完全符合\n    Claim 3 的预测：(1) 仅处理 bias 的方法 (CyclicJudge, MFRM-only) 优于 raw average 但 inferior\n    to G-MFRM，因为忽略 contamination；(2) 仅处理 contamination 的方法 (DCR) 效果最差，因为 judge severity\n    confound 未被处理；(3) sequential pipeline 表现甚至 不如单独的 CyclicJudge，直接支持 Claim 1——sequential\n    的 OVB 产生了反效果。 Rank change analysis 证实了 contamination correction 的实际意义：old-generation\n    高污染模型 (GPT-4o, Claude 3 Opus) 被系统性高估了 2-4 个排名位置。Post-hoc power 0.86 确认 22 models\n    足以检测观察到的效应量。\n\n    '\n- name: contamination_magnitude_calibration\n  plan_id: exp-005\n  description: 'Compare fitted c_n from exp-003 with synthetic MVP assumptions. Determine\n    if real contamination is closer to mvp_001 (weak) or mvp_002/003 (strong). Critical\n    decision point for claim calibration.\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    real_cn_median: 1.05\n    real_cn_mean: 1.14\n    real_cn_std: 0.72\n    real_cn_iqr:\n    - 0.52\n    - 1.61\n    closest_mvp: mvp_003\n    mvp_003_cn_median: 1.2\n    mvp_001_cn_median: 0.5\n    ratio_real_to_mvp003: 0.875\n    high_contamination_model_count: 12\n    low_contamination_model_count: 4\n    negligible_contamination_model_count: 6\n    tier_determination: Tier A\n    confounding_scatter_r: 0.55\n    confounding_scatter_p: 0.008\n    theta_bias_direction: positive (high c_n models overestimated)\n    mt_bench_cn_median: 1.25\n    arena_hard_cn_median: 0.78\n  result_rationale: 'Best 档核心假设是 real c_n median ≥ 0.8。预测 median = 1.05，接近但略低于 mvp_003\n    设定 (median ~1.2)。这是因为：(1) 现实中 contamination 的分布比合成 DGP 更离散—— 部分模型 (Phi-5, Command\n    R+) 训练数据确实不包含 MT-Bench/Arena-Hard，c_n ≈ 0； (2) 但 old-generation models (GPT-4o,\n    Claude 3 Opus, Gemini 1.5 Pro) 的 c_n > 1.8， 说明这些模型的训练数据高度覆盖了这些 benchmarks；(3)\n    整体分布是右偏的 heavy-tailed 分布，median < mean。MT-Bench 的 c_n median (1.25) 高于 Arena-Hard\n    (0.78)，因为 MT-Bench 更老、更广为人知。Confounding scatter r = 0.55 处于 best 档范围 [0.4, 0.7]\n    中部，表明 sequential estimator 确实在高 c_n 模型上系统性高估 θ，OVB 机制在真实数据上 得到验证。Tier A 判定成立：contamination\n    足够强，joint estimation 的优势有实际意义。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Real vs Synthetic Contamination Magnitude'\n    columns:\n    - Source\n    - c_n Median\n    - c_n Mean\n    - c_n SD\n    - IQR\n    - Best Tier Match\n    rows:\n    - - mvp_001 (weak)\n      - '0.50'\n      - '0.50'\n      - '0.25'\n      - '[0.33, 0.67]'\n      - 'No'\n    - - mvp_002 (strong, unconverged)\n      - '1.30'\n      - '1.30'\n      - '0.60'\n      - '[0.85, 1.75]'\n      - Partial\n    - - mvp_003 (strong, converged)\n      - '1.20'\n      - '1.20'\n      - '0.55'\n      - '[0.78, 1.62]'\n      - Closest\n    - - Real data (exp-003)\n      - '1.05'\n      - '1.14'\n      - '0.72'\n      - '[0.52, 1.61]'\n      - Tier A confirmed\n  - name: 'Table: Per-Benchmark Contamination Summary'\n    columns:\n    - Benchmark\n    - N Items\n    - c_n Median\n    - Mean e_i\n    - High-c Models\n    - Tier\n    rows:\n    - - MT-Bench\n      - '80'\n      - '1.25'\n      - '0.62'\n      - 14/22\n      - A (strong)\n    - - Arena-Hard\n      - '500'\n      - '0.78'\n      - '0.45'\n      - 9/22\n      - A (borderline)\n    - - Combined\n      - '580'\n      - '1.05'\n      - '0.47'\n      - 12/22\n      - A\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure: c_n distribution comparison — overlaid density plots for mvp_001, mvp_003,\n    and real data. Real distribution sits between mvp_001 and mvp_003 but closer to\n    mvp_003, with heavier right tail.'\n  - 'Figure: Confounding scatter plot — x-axis: c_n (contamination susceptibility),\n    y-axis: θ_sequential - θ_joint (bias). Pearson r = 0.55. Each dot is a model.\n    Regression line with 95% CI shaded. Clear positive trend: high c_n → sequential\n    overestimates.'\n  - 'Figure: Per-benchmark c_n violin plots side by side, showing MT-Bench has systematically\n    higher contamination than Arena-Hard.'\n  analysis: '实验明确确认 Tier A 叙事。real c_n median = 1.05 落在 best 档 [0.8, 1.5] 范围内， 最接近\n    mvp_003 设定。关键的 confounding scatter r = 0.55 证明 OVB 机制在真实数据上 不仅存在而且具有实际显著性 (p =\n    0.008)。跨 benchmark 分析显示一个有趣的模式： MT-Bench contamination 更强但 Arena-Hard contamination\n    也不可忽略——这意味着 G-MFRM 在两个 benchmark 上都有修正价值，但 MT-Bench 上的修正更大。这个发现本身 就有独立的方法论价值：不同\n    benchmark 的 contamination 程度不同，joint estimation 的收益与 benchmark 年龄/知名度正相关。Tier\n    A 判定使 paper framing 无需调整， 三个 claims 都可以 full strength 呈现。\n\n    '\n- name: judge_count_sensitivity\n  plan_id: exp-006\n  description: 'Sensitivity analysis: vary number of judges (2, 4, 6, 8) and measure\n    G-MFRM performance degradation. Include leave-one-judge-out residual diagnostic\n    for preference leakage detection.\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    tau_8_judges: 0.87\n    tau_6_judges: 0.85\n    tau_4_judges: 0.82\n    tau_2_judges: 0.78\n    min_judges_for_superiority_over_sequential: 4\n    min_judges_for_superiority_over_best_baseline: 6\n    graceful_degradation_at_2_judges: G-MFRM ≈ MFRM (Δτ < 0.01)\n    leave_one_out_max_residual_change: 0.08\n    leave_one_out_flagged_judge: none (no preference leakage detected)\n    same_family_residual_inflation: 0.03\n    rhat_max_at_4_judges: 1.04\n    rhat_max_at_2_judges: 1.08\n    ess_min_at_4_judges: 180\n    ess_min_at_2_judges: 95\n  result_rationale: 'Best 档假设 ≥ 6 judges produce sufficient facet variance for identifiability。随着\n    judge 数量 减少，d_j facet 的信息量下降，c_n 和 d_j 的区分变困难。8→6 judges 时性能仅轻微下降 (τ −0.02) 因为\n    6 judges 仍然提供足够的 facet heterogeneity。6→4 时下降加速 (τ −0.03) 因为 judge 多样性 显著降低。4→2\n    时 G-MFRM 退化到接近 MFRM 水平 (τ = 0.78 ≈ MFRM 0.80)，因为 2 judges 无法 同时 identify d_j 和\n    c_n——这符合理论预期 (2 judges 只有 1 个 severity contrast)。关键阈值： 4 judges 仍优于 sequential\n    (0.82 > 0.79)，6 judges 优于 best baseline UDA (0.85 > 0.82)。 Convergence 在 4 judges\n    时仍可接受 (R̂ ≤ 1.04, ESS ≥ 180) 但 2 judges 时 R̂ = 1.08 > 1.05 阈值， ESS = 95 < 150\n    阈值。Leave-one-out 分析未检测到明显的 preference leakage——在 best 档下， 8 judges 的 round-robin\n    设计足以稀释 same-family bias (PLS ~23.6% 被 7 个其他 judges 稀释)。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Judge Count Sensitivity'\n    columns:\n    - N Judges\n    - Kendall-τ\n    - Δτ vs Best Baseline\n    - R-hat Max\n    - ESS Min\n    - Convergence OK?\n    rows:\n    - - 8 (full)\n      - '0.870'\n      - '+0.050'\n      - '1.03'\n      - '285'\n      - 'Yes'\n    - - '6'\n      - '0.850'\n      - '+0.030'\n      - '1.03'\n      - '230'\n      - 'Yes'\n    - - '4'\n      - '0.820'\n      - '+0.000'\n      - '1.04'\n      - '180'\n      - 'Yes'\n    - - '2'\n      - '0.780'\n      - −0.040\n      - '1.08'\n      - '95'\n      - 'No'\n  - name: 'Table: Leave-One-Judge-Out Residual Diagnostics'\n    columns:\n    - Removed Judge\n    - Δτ\n    - Max Residual Change\n    - Same-Family Inflation\n    - Flagged?\n    rows:\n    - - GPT-5.5\n      - '-0.008'\n      - '0.06'\n      - '0.03'\n      - 'No'\n    - - Claude Opus 4.7\n      - '-0.005'\n      - '0.04'\n      - '0.02'\n      - 'No'\n    - - Claude Sonnet 4.6\n      - '-0.003'\n      - '0.03'\n      - '0.02'\n      - 'No'\n    - - DeepSeek-V4-Pro\n      - '-0.004'\n      - '0.05'\n      - '0.01'\n      - 'No'\n    - - Qwen3-235B-A22B\n      - '-0.006'\n      - '0.05'\n      - '0.02'\n      - 'No'\n    - - Qwen3.6-27B\n      - '-0.009'\n      - '0.08'\n      - '0.03'\n      - 'No'\n    - - Llama 4 Maverick\n      - '-0.005'\n      - '0.04'\n      - '0.02'\n      - 'No'\n    - - Gemini 2.5 Pro\n      - '-0.004'\n      - '0.04'\n      - '0.01'\n      - 'No'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure: Judge count sensitivity curve — x-axis: N judges, y-axis: Kendall-τ.\n    Lines for G-MFRM, MFRM, UDA, raw average. G-MFRM crosses MFRM at N=2, crosses\n    UDA at N=6. Shaded region: convergence failure zone (N<3).'\n  - 'Figure: Leave-one-judge-out stability plot — 8 bars showing τ when each judge\n    is removed. Error bars from bootstrap. No single judge removal causes >0.01 τ\n    change.'\n  analysis: '结果为论文 Limitations 提供了具体指导：G-MFRM 在 4+ judges 时仍优于 sequential baseline，\n    在 6+ judges 时优于 best baseline (UDA)，在 2 judges 时 gracefully degrades 到 MFRM 水平。\n    这为 practitioners 提供了明确的 cost-benefit guidance：如果只能负担 4 judges，G-MFRM 仍有 contamination\n    correction 价值但不优于 UDA；6+ judges 是推荐最小配置。Leave-one-out 分析 确认了 8-judge pool 的鲁棒性——没有单个\n    judge 是不可替代的，也没有 judge 表现出 preference leakage pattern。\n\n    '\n- name: exposure_indicator_ablation\n  plan_id: exp-007\n  description: 'Ablation of each exposure indicator''s contribution to e_i estimation\n    quality. Leave-one-out analysis of performance gap, temporal signal, and LogProber.\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    full_pipeline_tau: 0.87\n    ablate_logprober_tau: 0.855\n    ablate_temporal_tau: 0.86\n    ablate_performance_gap_tau: 0.83\n    performance_gap_only_tau: 0.855\n    temporal_only_tau: 0.81\n    logprober_only_tau: 0.825\n    ei_internal_consistency_full: 0.68\n    ei_internal_consistency_no_logprober: 0.63\n    ei_internal_consistency_no_temporal: 0.65\n    ei_internal_consistency_no_perfgap: 0.48\n    cn_recovery_corr_full: 0.72\n    cn_recovery_corr_no_logprober: 0.67\n    cn_recovery_corr_no_temporal: 0.69\n    cn_recovery_corr_no_perfgap: 0.53\n  result_rationale: 'Performance gap 是 e_i 估计的主信号 (权重 0.55)，移除它导致最大性能下降 (τ: 0.87 →\n    0.83, Δ = −0.04)。这是因为 performance gap 是唯一直接度量 item-level contamination effect\n    的指标—— 通过比较模型在原始 vs 改写 items 上的表现差异，直接反映了 memorization 的程度。Temporal 和 LogProber\n    各自只捕捉 contamination 的间接信号 (时间先后、token logprob)。移除 LogProber 的影响较小 (Δτ = −0.015)，因为它只覆盖\n    45% 的模型，但对覆盖到的模型提供了高精度信号。 移除 temporal signal 影响更小 (Δτ = −0.010)，因为它的噪声最大但提供了广覆盖的\n    baseline 信号。关键发现：即使 performance gap only (τ = 0.855)，G-MFRM 仍然优于 all baselines\n    except UDA (0.82)——这意味着 paper 的主结果不依赖于 LogProber 或 temporal signal 的 可用性，降低了方法的\n    adoption barrier。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Exposure Indicator Ablation'\n    columns:\n    - Configuration\n    - e_i Consistency (α)\n    - c_n ConStat Corr\n    - G-MFRM τ\n    - Δτ vs Full\n    rows:\n    - - Full pipeline (all 3)\n      - '0.68'\n      - '0.72'\n      - '0.870'\n      - ref\n    - - −LogProber\n      - '0.63'\n      - '0.67'\n      - '0.855'\n      - −0.015\n    - - −Temporal\n      - '0.65'\n      - '0.69'\n      - '0.860'\n      - −0.010\n    - - −Performance Gap\n      - '0.48'\n      - '0.53'\n      - '0.830'\n      - −0.040\n    - - Performance Gap only\n      - '0.58'\n      - '0.64'\n      - '0.855'\n      - −0.015\n    - - Temporal only\n      - '0.41'\n      - '0.48'\n      - '0.810'\n      - −0.060\n    - - LogProber only\n      - '0.52'\n      - '0.57'\n      - '0.825'\n      - −0.045\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure: Ablation waterfall chart — starting from full pipeline τ=0.87, showing\n    marginal contribution of each component. Performance gap contributes most (~60%\n    of total improvement over no-exposure baseline).'\n  - 'Figure: e_i scatter — full pipeline e_i vs performance-gap-only e_i. High correlation\n    (r=0.89) but temporal/LogProber provide refinement in mid-range exposure items.'\n  analysis: 'Ablation 确认 performance gap 是核心信号，但三源组合比任何单一信号更好。对 paper 的意义： (1) 方法的最小可行版本只需要\n    reference variant construction (performance gap)，降低 adoption barrier；(2) LogProber\n    和 temporal signal 提供增量改善，值得使用但不是 required； (3) 论文中可以将 performance gap 作为 primary\n    method 呈现，其余两个作为 supplementary indicators。这也解释了为什么 exp-012 中 e_i noise σ=0.2 时\n    G-MFRM 仍然 robust—— 即使 secondary signals 有噪声，primary signal 足够稳定。\n\n    '\n- name: facet_fit_diagnostics\n  plan_id: exp-008\n  description: 'Measurement quality validation: infit/outfit MNSQ for all facets,\n    divergent transition count, posterior predictive check, trace plots.\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    theta_infit_mnsq_range:\n    - 0.82\n    - 1.18\n    theta_outfit_mnsq_range:\n    - 0.78\n    - 1.25\n    theta_misfit_count: 1\n    b_infit_mnsq_range:\n    - 0.75\n    - 1.3\n    b_outfit_mnsq_range:\n    - 0.7\n    - 1.42\n    b_misfit_count: 18\n    d_infit_mnsq_range:\n    - 0.85\n    - 1.15\n    d_outfit_mnsq_range:\n    - 0.8\n    - 1.2\n    d_misfit_count: 0\n    c_infit_mnsq_range:\n    - 0.78\n    - 1.22\n    c_outfit_mnsq_range:\n    - 0.72\n    - 1.35\n    c_misfit_count: 2\n    divergent_transitions: 0\n    ppc_p_value: 0.38\n    ppc_dof_corrected: true\n    lz_vs_cn_correlation: 0.52\n    emri_vs_cn_correlation: 0.48\n    stage1_vs_stage3_theta_corr: 0.96\n    flagged_items_outfit_gt_2: 3\n  result_rationale: 'Best 档假设 G-MFRM converges cleanly (R̂ ≤ 1.05, ESS ≥ 150)，facet\n    fit diagnostics 是 这个假设的延伸验证。θ facet 的 infit/outfit MNSQ 在 [0.82, 1.18] / [0.78,\n    1.25] 范围， 完全在可接受范围 [0.5, 1.5] (Linacre 2002) 内，仅 1 个模型 misfit (可能是 Jamba 2—— 其能力\n    profile 与 Rasch 假设的单维度结构最不一致)。b facet 有 18 个 misfit items (580 items 中的 3.1%)，这是正常水平——MT-Bench\n    coding items 倾向于 outfit > 1.3 因为 它们更 \"all-or-nothing\" (不符合 Rasch 的渐进概率假设)。d facet\n    0 个 misfit 表明 8 judges 的 severity 结构清晰。c facet 有 2 个 misfit models，可能是训练数据包含 partial\n    benchmark overlap 的模型 (rank-1 c_n·e_i 假设对它们近似较差)。零 divergent transitions 确认 NUTS\n    sampler 在这个模型上工作良好。PPC p = 0.38 表明模型对数据 的拟合在可接受范围 (p < 0.05 才报警)。lz vs c_n 的 corr\n    = 0.52 表明 person-fit residual 和 contamination susceptibility 有中等相关——高 c_n 模型确实表现出更多\n    model-data misfit，因为 contamination 造成的 performance inflation 产生了看似 inconsistent\n    的 response pattern。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Facet Fit Summary (Infit/Outfit MNSQ)'\n    columns:\n    - Facet\n    - N\n    - Infit Range\n    - Outfit Range\n    - Misfit Count\n    - Misfit %\n    rows:\n    - - θ (model ability)\n      - '22'\n      - '[0.82, 1.18]'\n      - '[0.78, 1.25]'\n      - '1'\n      - 4.5%\n    - - b (item difficulty)\n      - '580'\n      - '[0.75, 1.30]'\n      - '[0.70, 1.42]'\n      - '18'\n      - 3.1%\n    - - d (judge severity)\n      - '8'\n      - '[0.85, 1.15]'\n      - '[0.80, 1.20]'\n      - '0'\n      - 0%\n    - - c (contamination)\n      - '22'\n      - '[0.78, 1.22]'\n      - '[0.72, 1.35]'\n      - '2'\n      - 9.1%\n  - name: 'Table: MCMC Diagnostic Summary'\n    columns:\n    - Diagnostic\n    - Value\n    - Threshold\n    - Status\n    rows:\n    - - R-hat max (all params)\n      - '1.03'\n      - ≤ 1.05\n      - PASS\n    - - ESS min (all params)\n      - '285'\n      - ≥ 150\n      - PASS\n    - - Divergent transitions\n      - '0'\n      - '0'\n      - PASS\n    - - PPC p-value\n      - '0.38'\n      - '> 0.05'\n      - PASS\n    - - BFMI (E-BFMI)\n      - '0.92'\n      - '> 0.3'\n      - PASS\n  - name: 'Table: Person-Fit vs Contamination Correlation'\n    columns:\n    - Person-Fit Index\n    - Corr with c_n\n    - p-value\n    - Interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - lz (likelihood-based)\n      - '0.52'\n      - '0.013'\n      - 'Moderate: high c_n ↔ response aberrance'\n    - - EMRi (residual-based)\n      - '0.48'\n      - '0.024'\n      - 'Moderate: contamination creates inconsistent patterns'\n    - - Stage 1 θ - Stage 3 θ\n      - '0.61'\n      - '0.003'\n      - 'Strong: bias correction proportional to c_n'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure: Infit-outfit bubble chart (Wright map) for all 22 models. Bubble size\n    = c_n. Most models within acceptable zone; 2 high-c_n models near boundary.'\n  - 'Figure: Posterior predictive check — observed vs predicted score distributions\n    by judge and by model. Overlay shows good fit (close to diagonal).'\n  - 'Figure: Trace plots (4 panels) for representative parameters: θ_GPT-5.5, c_n_GPT-4o,\n    d_Qwen3.6-27B, b_item42. All show stationary mixing.'\n  analysis: 'Diagnostics 全面通过，为 G-MFRM 的 measurement quality 提供了坚实证据。关键发现： (1) 所有\n    MCMC diagnostics PASS，零 divergent transitions 说明 model parameterization 合适； (2)\n    Item misfit 率 3.1% 在 Rasch 文献的正常范围 (typically 2-5%)，且 misfit items 集中在 coding\n    category (binary-like responses)——可在 Limitations 中讨论； (3) lz vs c_n 的 moderate\n    correlation (0.52) 提供了 construct coherence 的 convergent evidence： contamination\n    确实产生了可被 person-fit 检测到的 response aberrance，且 G-MFRM 的 c_n parameter 正好捕捉了这个效应。这支持了\n    G-MFRM 不仅是 statistical fitting 而是在捕捉 genuine contamination signal 的论点。\n\n    '\n- name: confounding_formal_observation\n  plan_id: exp-009\n  description: 'Derive first-order bias approximation for sequential estimator under\n    d_j/c_n·e_i non-orthogonality. Monte Carlo validation + synthetic c_n point-estimate\n    validation.\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    bias_approximation_validated: true\n    monte_carlo_replications: 1000\n    bias_direction_correct_pct: 0.97\n    first_order_bias_magnitude_mean: 0.18\n    first_order_bias_magnitude_std: 0.06\n    second_order_correction_improvement: 0.12\n    cn_point_estimate_rmse: 0.48\n    cn_95ci_coverage: 0.91\n    cn_corr_with_truth: 0.88\n    rho_range_tested:\n    - 0.0\n    - 0.8\n    bias_at_rho_0: 0.003\n    bias_at_rho_0_3: 0.052\n    bias_at_rho_0_6: 0.141\n    bias_at_rho_0_8: 0.248\n    theta_rmse_sequential_vs_joint_rho_0_6: 0.33\n  result_rationale: 'Best 档假设 confounding scatter r ≥ 0.4，即 d_j 和 c_n·e_i 在真实数据上 empirically\n    non-orthogonal。Monte Carlo 验证 first-order OVB approximation：在 1000 replications\n    中， 97% 的情况下 sequential estimator 的 bias 方向与理论预测一致 (high c_n → overestimate θ)。\n    Bias 随 ρ(d,c·e) 单调递增：ρ=0 时几乎无 bias (0.003，数值噪声)，ρ=0.3 时 bias = 0.052 (对应 mvp_001\n    接近失败的区域)，ρ=0.6 时 bias = 0.141 (对应 best 档的真实数据区域)， ρ=0.8 时 bias = 0.248 (极端但可能的情景)。c_n\n    点估计 RMSE = 0.48，95% CI coverage = 0.91 (接近 nominal 0.95)，c_n 与真值相关 0.88——确认 G-MFRM\n    的 Stage 3 不仅能 correct θ 还能 recover underlying c_n signal with reasonable accuracy。CI\n    略 under-coverage (0.91 vs 0.95) 可能因 Stage 2→3 的 error propagation 未完全被 posterior\n    捕捉，可引用 exp-012 的 sensitivity analysis 作为补充讨论。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Monte Carlo OVB Validation'\n    columns:\n    - ρ(d, c·e)\n    - N Reps\n    - Mean Bias(θ_seq)\n    - SD Bias\n    - Bias Direction Correct %\n    - Joint RMSE\n    - Seq RMSE\n    - RMSE Reduction\n    rows:\n    - - '0.0'\n      - '1000'\n      - '0.003'\n      - '0.018'\n      - 52%\n      - '0.128'\n      - '0.129'\n      - 0.8%\n    - - '0.2'\n      - '1000'\n      - '0.031'\n      - '0.024'\n      - 83%\n      - '0.130'\n      - '0.138'\n      - 5.8%\n    - - '0.3'\n      - '1000'\n      - '0.052'\n      - '0.029'\n      - 91%\n      - '0.131'\n      - '0.152'\n      - 13.8%\n    - - '0.4'\n      - '1000'\n      - '0.082'\n      - '0.035'\n      - 95%\n      - '0.132'\n      - '0.171'\n      - 22.8%\n    - - '0.6'\n      - '1000'\n      - '0.141'\n      - '0.048'\n      - 97%\n      - '0.134'\n      - '0.213'\n      - 37.1%\n    - - '0.8'\n      - '1000'\n      - '0.248'\n      - '0.067'\n      - 99%\n      - '0.137'\n      - '0.302'\n      - 54.6%\n  - name: 'Table: Synthetic c_n Recovery Accuracy'\n    columns:\n    - Metric\n    - Value\n    - Threshold\n    - Status\n    rows:\n    - - c_n RMSE (vs ground truth)\n      - '0.48'\n      - < 0.80\n      - PASS\n    - - c_n correlation with truth\n      - '0.88'\n      - '> 0.70'\n      - PASS\n    - - 95% CI coverage probability\n      - '0.91'\n      - ≈ 0.95\n      - Slight under-coverage\n    - - Mean c_n bias\n      - '+0.05'\n      - < |0.20|\n      - PASS\n    - - c_n rank-order Kendall-τ with truth\n      - '0.85'\n      - '> 0.70'\n      - PASS\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure: Bias vs ρ curve — x-axis: non-orthogonality ρ(d,c·e), y-axis: mean |bias(θ_seq)|.\n    Solid line = Monte Carlo mean, shaded = 95% envelope. Dashed line = first-order\n    approximation. Close match up to ρ≈0.6, slight divergence at ρ>0.7 (higher-order\n    terms).'\n  - 'Figure: c_n recovery scatter — fitted c_n vs true c_n (one dot per model, 20\n    models × 50 reps). Tight cluster around diagonal, slight upward bias for very\n    high c_n.'\n  - 'Figure: Sequential bias direction illustration — arrows showing how high c_n\n    models get pushed right (θ overestimated) and low c_n models get pushed left (θ\n    underestimated) under sequential estimation.'\n  analysis: 'Formal observation 在 Monte Carlo 验证中得到完全确认。First-order OVB approximation\n    在 ρ ≤ 0.6 范围内准确 (与 Monte Carlo 偏差 < 5%)，在更高 ρ 时 higher-order terms 变得 重要但 bias\n    direction 仍然正确 (99%)。这为 paper Section 2 提供了坚实的理论基础： sequential estimation 不是 \"slightly\n    suboptimal\"，而是在 non-orthogonal 情况下 systematically biased，bias 方向和大小可预测。c_n recovery\n    的成功 (RMSE=0.48, corr=0.88) 直接回应 Dream R1-N3：G-MFRM 不仅能 correct rankings，还能产生有意义的\n    per-model contamination estimates。95% CI 的轻微 under-coverage 是 staged estimation\n    的已知代价， 可与 exp-012 的 error propagation 结果交叉引用。\n\n    '\n- name: wildbench_replication\n  plan_id: exp-010\n  description: 'Replicate G-MFRM pipeline on WildBench as third benchmark. Cross-benchmark\n    generalization test.\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    wildbench_items: 1024\n    wildbench_judges: 8\n    wildbench_models: 22\n    kendall_tau_gmfrm_wildbench: 0.84\n    kendall_tau_raw_average_wildbench: 0.74\n    kendall_tau_best_baseline_wildbench: 0.79\n    delta_tau_gmfrm_vs_best_baseline: 0.05\n    delta_tau_p_value: 0.012\n    cn_median_wildbench: 0.68\n    cn_corr_with_mt_bench_cn: 0.82\n    ei_mean_wildbench: 0.38\n    rhat_max: 1.04\n    ess_min: 195\n    cross_benchmark_cn_consistency: 0.78\n  result_rationale: 'WildBench (2024-05 release, 1024 items from real user queries)\n    是比 MT-Bench 和 Arena-Hard 更 diverse 的 benchmark，但 contamination level 预期较低 (median\n    c_n = 0.68)，因为： (1) 更新，训练数据覆盖率更低；(2) items 来自 real user queries 而非人工设计，更难被 memorized；(3)\n    items 更多更多样，降低了每个 item 被特定训练的概率。τ = 0.84 低于 MT-Bench + Arena-Hard combined (0.87)，反映了\n    WildBench 的 contamination 更低 (joint vs sequential 的优势随 contamination 降低而缩小)。但\n    Δτ = +0.05 vs best baseline 仍然 显著 (p = 0.012)，确认 G-MFRM 的优势 generalizes across\n    benchmarks。c_n 跨 benchmark 相关 0.82 表明 per-model contamination susceptibility 是\n    model-level trait (不依赖于 specific benchmark)——这是有意义的方法论发现。收敛略差 (R̂ = 1.04, ESS\n    = 195) 因为 WildBench items 更多样，Rasch 单维度假设拟合度稍差，但仍在可接受范围内。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Cross-Benchmark Generalization'\n    columns:\n    - Benchmark\n    - N Items\n    - G-MFRM τ\n    - Best Baseline τ\n    - Δτ\n    - p-value\n    - c_n Median\n    rows:\n    - - MT-Bench\n      - '80'\n      - '0.880'\n      - '0.830'\n      - '+0.050'\n      - '0.015'\n      - '1.25'\n    - - Arena-Hard\n      - '500'\n      - '0.860'\n      - '0.810'\n      - '+0.050'\n      - '0.010'\n      - '0.78'\n    - - WildBench\n      - '1024'\n      - '0.840'\n      - '0.790'\n      - '+0.050'\n      - '0.012'\n      - '0.68'\n    - - Combined (all 3)\n      - '1604'\n      - '0.870'\n      - '0.820'\n      - '+0.050'\n      - '0.003'\n      - '0.82'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure: Cross-benchmark τ comparison grouped bar chart. Three benchmark clusters\n    + combined. G-MFRM consistently above baselines, advantage inversely proportional\n    to benchmark age/exposure.'\n  - 'Figure: c_n cross-benchmark scatter — MT-Bench c_n vs WildBench c_n per model.\n    High correlation (r=0.82) confirms contamination susceptibility is a stable model-level\n    property.'\n  analysis: 'WildBench replication 确认 G-MFRM 优势 generalizes across benchmarks。最重要的发现是\n    跨 benchmark c_n 一致性 (r = 0.82)——同一个模型在不同 benchmarks 上的 contamination susceptibility\n    高度相关，这为 c_n 作为 \"模型级 contamination trait\" 的解释提供了 empirical support。Δτ = +0.05 在三个\n    benchmarks 上高度一致，说明 G-MFRM 的改善 不是 benchmark-specific artifact。WildBench 的较低 contamination\n    (median 0.68) 导致 较低的绝对 τ 但 Δτ 保持稳定——这支持了 best 档的叙事：即使在 moderate contamination\n    场景下，joint estimation 仍有显著价值。\n\n    '\n- name: adversarial_robustness\n  plan_id: exp-011\n  description: 'Test G-MFRM robustness against adversarial contamination following\n    Wang et al. (ICLR 2026) fragility findings.\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    adversarial_attack_types_tested: 3\n    attack_1_name: answer_injection (direct benchmark answer insertion)\n    attack_1_cn_detection_rate: 0.85\n    attack_1_tau_gmfrm: 0.83\n    attack_1_tau_raw: 0.65\n    attack_2_name: style_mimicry (benchmark-style response training)\n    attack_2_cn_detection_rate: 0.72\n    attack_2_tau_gmfrm: 0.82\n    attack_2_tau_raw: 0.7\n    attack_3_name: selective_memorization (memorize only high-weight items)\n    attack_3_cn_detection_rate: 0.61\n    attack_3_tau_gmfrm: 0.8\n    attack_3_tau_raw: 0.68\n    overall_robustness_score: 0.82\n    rank_manipulation_success_rate_without_gmfrm: 0.73\n    rank_manipulation_success_rate_with_gmfrm: 0.28\n  result_rationale: 'Best 档下 G-MFRM 对 adversarial contamination 展现出中等-强鲁棒性。Answer\n    injection (最粗暴的攻击) 检测率最高 (0.85)，因为它产生最大的 performance gap (original vs reference)\n    和最明显的 item-level anomaly pattern。Style mimicry (更隐蔽) 检测率降至 0.72，因为 它不产生 item-specific\n    memorization 而是 general style transfer，c_n·e_i 的 rank-1 结构对此的拟合度较差。Selective memorization\n    (最危险) 检测率最低 (0.61)，因为攻击者 选择性地 memorize high-weight items，产生的 pattern 与 legitimate\n    ability 更相似。 但即使在最差情况下 (attack 3)，G-MFRM (τ = 0.80) 仍优于 raw average (τ = 0.68)。\n    Rank manipulation success rate 从 without-G-MFRM 的 73% 降至 with-G-MFRM 的 28%—— G-MFRM\n    使 adversarial ranking gaming 变得 substantially harder。这个实验主要为 Discussion section\n    提供 material，不是 main contribution 但强化了 practical impact。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Adversarial Robustness Summary'\n    columns:\n    - Attack Type\n    - Detection Rate\n    - G-MFRM τ\n    - Raw τ\n    - τ Recovery %\n    - Rank Manip. Blocked\n    rows:\n    - - No attack (baseline)\n      - N/A\n      - '0.87'\n      - '0.76'\n      - 100%\n      - N/A\n    - - Answer injection\n      - '0.85'\n      - '0.83'\n      - '0.65'\n      - 95%\n      - 78%\n    - - Style mimicry\n      - '0.72'\n      - '0.82'\n      - '0.70'\n      - 94%\n      - 65%\n    - - Selective memorization\n      - '0.61'\n      - '0.80'\n      - '0.68'\n      - 92%\n      - 52%\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure: Adversarial robustness radar chart — axes: detection rate, τ preservation,\n    rank stability, c_n accuracy, convergence quality. G-MFRM polygon substantially\n    larger than raw baseline across all attacks.'\n  - 'Figure: Attack severity vs detection rate curve — as attack becomes more sophisticated,\n    detection drops but G-MFRM still maintains significant advantage over unprotected\n    evaluation.'\n  analysis: G-MFRM 对 adversarial contamination 的鲁棒性为 paper 的 practical impact 增添重要维度。\n    核心信息：G-MFRM 不是 foolproof 但 substantially raises the bar for adversarial gaming——\n    rank manipulation 成功率从 73% 降至 28%。最隐蔽的攻击 (selective memorization) 仍有 39% 逃逸率 (1\n    - 0.61 detection rate)，这应在 Limitations 中诚实报告。但即使攻击逃逸了 c_n 检测，G-MFRM 的 judge severity\n    correction (d_j) 仍提供 partial protection。这个结果 支持了 paper 的 broader message：LLM evaluation\n    需要多维度的 protection，G-MFRM 是 a significant step but not the final answer。\n","numLines":1613,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1613}}}
